<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">Thiampi Laibu</book>
  <para style="h">Thiampi Laibu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thiampi Laibu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thiampi Laibu</para>
  <para style="mt">Thiampi Laibu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ompuina Puanbuk sung pan Topa in Moses sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te ii biakpiakna a nei ciang a zui tu in a nuai a ngeinate pia hi. Mihing khat pawpo in nganhing taw biakpiakna a nei ciang, a khuihon ahibuale, a tuuhon ahibuale a kealhonte sung pan khat pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khuihonte sung pan khat taw meihal biakpiakna a pia ahile, a mealhem ngawl khuital khat hi tu hi. Topa ii a saan natu in Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in khuital lu tungah a khut nga tu a, tuasia ama mawphel natu biakpiakna in kisaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualai ah ama in tua khuital ngo tu a, Aaron suan thiampite in khuital chi sia Topa tungah a piak zawkciang Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om biaknatau pangh li ah a chi the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a vun hoai in a sa sem tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thiampite in biaknatau tungah thing seng in mei taw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in a kisemsa sabak teng, a lu le a thau taw mei tungah koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a sungkua le a nungpeangte nii, sil tu a vaipuak nei thiampipa in sa teng biaknatau ah hal tu hi. Tua an taw biakpiakna ii ngimnam sia in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing khat in a tuu ahibuale a kealte sung pan khat taw biakpiakna a nei le, a mealhem ngawl a tal khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in biaknatau saksang ah tuasia ngo tu a, biaknatau pangh li ah thiampite in a chi the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sa a sem zawkciang thiampipa in a sa teng mei tungah koi tu a, a lu le a thau zongh kihel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a sungkua le a nungpeangte nii sil tu a, thiampipa in Topa tungah biakpiaknate pia in biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. Tua an taw biakpiakna ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat in vacim khat taw meihal biakpiakna a pia le, ngam vakhu khat ahi buale, inn vakhu khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampipa in tua biakpiakna sia biaknatau ah paipui tu a, a ngawng meaktan in, biaknatau tungah a lu hal tu hi. Biaknatau pangh ah a chi taaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A longtawl le a tawl sungah a om teng la tu a, vut koina, biaknatau ii nisuana sangah vawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a thate nii pan len tu a, a thate tatsak ngawlin a pum balkeak tu a, biaknatau tungah a pum bup hal tu hi. Tua an taw biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in antang taw Topa biakpiakna a nei ciang, antang ngoaivui masa nanak tu hi. Ama in olive thau le ngimnamtui buak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron suan thiampite kungah paipui tu hi. Thiampipa in anvui khutdim khat, sathau le ngimnamtui theampo la in, Topa tungah kipia siat zo hi ci in a kiheak thei natu in biaknatau ah hal tu hi. Tua an biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A taanglai antang teng thiampite neisa hi a, Topa a kipia an sung pan a laak ahikom, thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kipia anluum sia, anluum emna bealpeu sungah em ahile, tol saw ngawl hi nanak tu hi. Tuasia olive thau taw a kihel a anluum liante ahibuale olive thau taw a kizut a muhpaate hi thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kipia anluum sia moh emna taw minsak ahile, olive thau le anvui a kihel hi tu a, ahizong tol saw ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biakpiakna in na nei ciang, tuasia balneen in a tungah sathau na buak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beal baannei taw a kihuan anluum a kipia ahile, olive thau le anvui taw huan hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi an sia Topa tungah biakpiakna khat in paipui a, thiampipa tungah pia in, biaknatau ah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A vekpi in Topa tungah a kipia a hina thu limlakna in thiampipa in tawm la a, biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. Tua an biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A taanglai biakpiaknate thiampite neisa hi a; Topa a kipia an sung pan a kila ahikom, thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa a kipia antang taw biakpiaknate tol kisaw ngawl tu a; Topa tungah na piak an sungah khuaitui ahibuale tol na zangh ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anpal taw biakpiakna khat kum simin na paipui tu uh a, ahizong biaknatau ah na hal buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Antang taw biakpiakna theampo ah ci saw vun, banghang ziam cile ci sia noma le Pathian kilaklaw ah thuciamna lim ahi hi. (Biakpiakna theampo ah ci saw nanak vun.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anpal taw Topa tungah biakpiakna na nei uh ciang, kan sa antang ahibuale ngoaivui sa an hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua tungah olive thau helin ngimnamtui na buak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna a hina, limlakna in antawm, sathau le ngimnamtui theampo zongh thiampipa in hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in kipawlkhop biakpiakna in a khuite khat a piak ciang a mealhem ngawl a tal ahibuale a nu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tua nganhing lu tungah a khut nga tu a, Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah ngo tu hi. Aaron suan thiampite in biaknatau pangh li ah a chi the tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a nuai a sa teng Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna in pia tu hi: a sungthau theampo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a nautate le a nauta tuam a thau teng le a thinsa phabel teng pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thiampite in hi teng theampo meihal biakpiaknate taw biaknatau tungah hal khawm tu hi. Hi an taw biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kipawlkhop biakpiakna khat ah tuu ahibuale keal a kizangh le; anu zongh apa zongh hi thei a, ahizong a mealhem ngawl het hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing khat in tuu taw a bia le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuu lu tungah a khut nga tu a, Puanbuk mai ah ngo tu hi. Thiampite in biaknatau pangh li ah a chi the tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a nuai a, nganhing sanam teng Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna in pia tu hi: a thau, a cingpingu dongin a kitan a meici thau buppi, a sungkua a tuam a thau theampo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a nauta le a nauta tuam a thau teng le a thinsa phabel teng pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna khat ahi bangma vaipuak nei thiampipa in biaknatau tungah hal siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat in keal a pia le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a keal lu tungah a khut nga tu a, Puanbuk mai ah ngo tu hi. Thiampite in biaknatau pangh li ah a chi the tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a nuai a sa teng Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna in pia tu hi: a sungthau theampo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a nauta le a nauta tuam a thau teng, a thinsa phabel teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa a lungkimsak an taw biakpiakna ahi bangma, thiampipa in biaknatau tungah hal siat tu hi. A thau teng Topa neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel te in a thau ahizong, a chi ahizong, ne thei ngawl tu hi; hi thu in Israel te theampo ii a teenna mun pawpo ah a tawntung a zui tu ngeina khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a maw a khial mihing khat in tupkhol ngawlin Topa thupiakte khat pawpo a paltan ciang, a zui tu a nuai a ngeinate Israel mite tungah a son natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maw a khial sia Thiampi Lianbelpa hi a, mipite tungah mawna khialna hong then ahile, ama mawna khialna hangin a mealhem ngawl khuital no khat Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk kongbiang ah khuital paipui tu a, a lu tungah a khut nga in Topa mai ah ngo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Thiampi Lianbelpa in khuital chi pawlkhat la in, Puanbuk sungah tumpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a khutme, chi sungah pap tu a, a thiangtho puankhai mai ah salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in chi pawlkhat, Puanbuk sung ngimnamtui biaknatau kingte ii a dokna teng noai tu hi, a taanglai chi teng Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om, meihal biakpiakna in a kizangh biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi khuital tung pan a thau teng theampo, a sungthaute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a nauta le a nauta tuam a thaute, le a thinsa phabel la tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampipa in tua a thau teng la tu a, kipawlkhop biakpiakna in a kingo nganhingte tung pan a thaute a hal bangin meihal biakpiak natu in a kizangh biaknatau tungah hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong ama in a vun, a tak teng, a lu, a peang teng, a ngil le a ngilzangte a kihel a sungkua teng la tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngiaphual puasang ah paipui in vut buakna, biakna a zeksa taw kisai a thiangthona munah thingthut in hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tupkhol ngawlin Israel taangpi bup in Topa thupiakte khat paltan in a maw a khial in ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a maw a khial a kiheak po ciang taangpi taangta in khuital khat taw mawphel biakpiakna nei tu hi. Amate in Topa ompuina Puanbuk ah paipui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />taangpi lampuite in a khui lu tungah a khutte nga in, tualai ah ngo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbelpa in khuital chi tawm Puanbuk sungah paipui tu a tua ii sungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a khutme papin puankhai mai ah salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Puanbuk sung ngimnamtui biaknatau king, a dokna tengah chi tawm noai tu a, a taanglai teng Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om, meihal biakpiakna in a kizangh biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a thau teng la in biaknatau tungah hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in mawphel biakpiakna in a kizangh khuital sia taw a vawt bangma in hi khuital zongh taw a kibangin vawt tu a, mipite ii mawna hu in hi bangin sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu hi, tuaciang amate mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in tua khuital ngiaphual pua sangah paipui in, ama mawmai natu biakpiakna khuital a hal bangin hal tu hi. Hisia in taangpite mawna maisak natu biakpiakna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngam uk khat in tupkhol ngawlin Topa thupiakte paltan in mawna a vawt le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a mawna a heak po ciang, a mealhem ngawl kealtal khat taw biakpiakna nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in kealtal lu tungah a khut nga tu a, meihal biakpiakna in nganhing a kingawna mun biaknatau saksang ah ngo tu hi. Hisia in mawphel biakpiakna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thiampipa in a chi sungah a khutme pap tu a, biaknatau king a kidokna tengah noai in, a taanglai teng biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in kipawlkhop biakpiakna in a kingo nganhing thaute kihal bangma in, biaknatau ah a thau teng hal tu hi. Ngam uk khat ii mawmai natu in hi bangin thiampipa in sangaw biakpiakna nei tu a, ngamukpa mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tupkhol ngawlin nautaang mi khat in Topa thupiakte paltan in, mawna a vawt le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a mawna a heak po ciang a mealhem ngawl kealnu khat taw biakpiakna nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in keallu tungah a khut nga tu a, meihal biakpiak natu nganhing kingawna mun, biaknatau saksang ah ngo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nganhing chi sungah thiampipa in a khutme pap tu a, biaknatau king a dokna teng noai in, a taanglai teng biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in kipawlkhop biakpiak natu in a kingo nganthaute laak bangin a thau teng la tu a, Topa a lungkimsak ngimnam ahi natu in biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. Hi bangin thiampipa in tua pa ii mawmai natu in, sangaw biakpiakna neisak tu a, a mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing khat in mawphel biakpiakna in tuu khat hong paipui le, a mealhem ngawl a nu khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in tuu lu tungah a khut nga tu a, meihal biakpiak natu in ngan kingawna mun biaknatau ii saksang ah ngo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thiampipa in a chi sungah a khutme pap tu a, biaknatau king ah a om a dokna teng chi noai in, a taanglai teng biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in kipawlkhop biakpiak natu in a kingo tuu thau laak bangin a thau teng la tu a, Topa tungah a kipia an taw biakpiaknate taw biaknatau tungah hal khawm tu hi. Hi bangin thiampipa in tua pa mawmai natu in sangaw biakpiakna nei tu a, ama mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nuai a thute ah mawphel biakpiaknate kisamh hi. Mihing khat sia thukhenzum ah tetti pang tu in kisam a, ama muna bang le a zaakna bangin a son buale ama in a piang bang a thuak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tup khol ngawlin, mihing khat in sathaang thi ci bang, biakna zeksa sang panin a thiang ngawl khat po a thamtha le, a vawt hunlam a phaw po ciang ama sia a thiang ngawl, a maw a khial ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tup khol ngawlin mihing khat in mihing sung pan a piang a thiang ngawl na khat pawpo a thamtha ahile bang po ahizong ama in a vawt hunlam a heak po ciang a maw a khial hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kidawm ngawlin, mihing khat in thu khat po ah a kiciam tha le zong a vawt hunlam a phaw po ciang ama a maw a khial ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing khat in a khial ciang a khialna pualaak nanak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mawna daan tu in Topa tungah tuu anu khat ahibuale keal anu khat pia tu hi. Tua pa mawmai natu in thiampipa in sangaw biakpiakna neisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khat in tuu ahibuale keal a pia zo buale, a mawmai natu in ngam vakhu nii ahibuale inn vakhu niite Topa tungah paipui tu a, a khat sia mawphel biakpiakna hi tu a, a dangkhat sia meihal biakpiakna hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in tuate thiampipa kungah paipui tu a, thiampipa in tua vacim taw mawphel biakpiakna nei masa tu hi. Ama in a lu tatsak ngawlin a ngawng meak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a chi pawlkhat biaknatau pangh the tu hi. A taanglai chi teng biaknatau bul ah sung tu hi. Hisia in mawphel biakpiakna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a niina vacim taw ngeina om bangin meihal biakpiakna pia tu hi. Hi bangin thiampipa in tua pa mawmai natu sangaw biakpiakna vawtsak tu a, tua pa mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi khat in ngam vakhu nii le inn vakhu nii a pia zo buale mawphel biakpiak natu in anvui kilogramme khat paipui tu hi. Antang taw biakpiakna hi ngawl a, mawphel biakpiakna ahikom, ama in olive thau ahibuale ngimnamtui a tungah buak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in thiampipa kungah paipui tu a, Topa tungah a vekpi a piak a lakna in thiampipa in khutdim khat la tu a, an taw biakpiakna in biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. Tua in mawphel biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bangin thiampipa in tua pa mawmai natu biakpiakna neisak tu a, ama mawna kimaisak tu hi. Antang taw biakpiakna bangma in a taanglai anvui teng thiampipa aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in tup khol ngawlin Topa tungah biakna taw kisai a thiangtho nate pia ngawlin a khial le ama in khialphel biakpiakna in a mealhem ngawl tuutal ahibuale kealtal khat Topa tungah pia tu hi. A man sia a khensat ngeina om bang kikhensat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A piak ngawl vanh teng ama in pia kik tu a, zakhat ciang kul taw in belap nanak tu hi. Ama in thiampipa tungah pia tu a, tua pa mawmai natu in nganhing taw biakpiakna khat thiampipa in neisak tu a, ama mawna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in tup khol ngawlin Topa thupiakte a paltan le, ama a khial hi a, a khialna daan thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khialphel natu in a mealhem ngawl tuutal khat ahibuale kealtal khat thiampipa tungah paipui tu hi. A man sia a ngeina om bangin kikhensat tu hi. Thiampipa in tupkhol ngawlin a khialpa khialphel natu in sangaw biakpiakna neisak tu a, ama khialna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hisia ama ii Topa tungah a khialna hu a, khialphel biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah a nuai a ngeinate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat tungah Israel a mipui khat in sum koi a, a koina pa in pia kik nuam ngawl ahizong, ama na nguksak ahizong, a theam ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a bo vanh khat mu napi leilot a mu bong ci in a kiciam ahile zong, Topa tungah maw ahikom biakpiakna khat a vawt kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bang khat pawpo taw mihing khat in a maw a khial ciang thumaan ngawlin a nga vanh pawpo pia kik hamtang tu hi. A khialna a kimu ni in, a neipa tungah a cingin pia kik tu a, zakhat ciang kul taw belap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah ama ii khialphel biakpiak natu in a mealhem ngawl tuutal ahibuale kealtal khat thiampipa kungah paipui tu hi. A man sia khensat ngeina om bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua pa mawmai natu in, thiampipa in biakpiakna piaksak tu a, ama khialna kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate ii meihal biakpiaknate a piak ciang a nuai a ngeinate a zui tu in thupia hi. Meihal biakpiakna sia zankhuateak biaknatau tungah kinusia tu a, tuaciang tua mei sia kuang tansak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in puanneal ngoaipuan tom le puanneal puantual sil a, biaknatau ah vut teng luakin, biaknatau pangh ah sung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in a puan laih tu a, ngiaphual puasang biakna taw kisai a thiangthona munah vutte bua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Biaknatau ah mei kuang topsak tu a, mitsak ngeingawl tu hi. Zing simin thiampipa in thing thut thua tu a, meihal biakpiakna vawtin, kipawlkhop biakpiakna sathaute hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biaknatau ah mei kuang topsak tu a, mitsak ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nuai a te sia antang biakpiakna ah zui tu ngeinate ahi hi. Aaron suan thiampipa in biaknatau mai Topa tungah antang biakpiakna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A vekpi in Topa tungah a kipia a hina thu heaksakna in ama in khutdim khat anvui le sathau, a tungah ngimnamtuite buakin, biaknatau ah hal tu hi. Hi biakpiakna ii ngim in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A taanglai teng thiampite in ne tu hi. Tuate tol kisaw ngawl anluum in ki em tu a, Topa ompuina Puanbuk suumsung a thiangtho munah kine tu hi. Tua sia an taw biakpiaknate a khensak bangin Topa ii thiampite a piaksa hi. Tua in mawphel biakpiakna le khialphel biakpiaknate bangin thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maisang hun theampo atu in Aaron suan le paal peuma in Topa tungah a kipia ante amate nga bangin ne tan thei tu uh hi. Midang khat pawpo tua biakpiakna an a thutha sia, a thianthona vaang in ngim ngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aaron suan thiampi khat thupha piak kipsak natu taw kisai ngeinate pia hi. Thupha piak kipsakna a nga ni in Topa tungah anvui kilogramme khat (ni sim antang biakpiakna za taw a kikim) zingsangin a lang, nitakin a lang pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuate sathau taw hel tu a, moh emna taw minsak in, balneen tu a, Topa tungah antang biakpiakna in pia tu hi, a ngim in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maisang hun theampo ah Aaron suan peuma Thiampi Lianbel a sep ciang hi biakpiakna vawt tu hi. Tua antang sia Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna bangin kihal tum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thiampipa ii a piak antang biakpiaknate tawm zongh kine thei ngawl hi; tua teng a kihal siat kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah Aaron le a tapate in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />a nuai a ngeinate mawphel biakpiakna a piak ciang a zui tu in thupia hi. Meihal biakpiak natu in sa a kingawna mun, biaknatau saksang ah mawphel biakpiak natu in nganhing kingo tu hi. Tua in a thiangtho mama biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiakna a pia thiampipa in a piak nganhing sate, Topa ompuina Puanbuk suumsung mun thiangthona ah ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo ahibuale na khat pawpo in tua nganhing sa a thutha le tuasia ii thianthona vaang in ngim ngasak tu hi. Tua sachi puan khat po tungah a baang tha le tuasia mun thiangtho na ah sawp kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sa huanna leibeal khat pawpo sia kisutham tu a, thikbeal a kizangh le nawt thiang in, tui taw silthiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thiampi innkuanpui pa pawpo in hi biakpiakna sa ne thei tu hi; tua biakpiakna sia thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong Puanbuk sungah sachi kipaipui in, mawmai natu in a zeksa vawtna ah a kizangh le tua sa kine ngawl het tu a; tuasia a kihal kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nuai a te sia khialphel biakpiaknate atu zui tu ngeinate hi a, thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meihal biakpiak natu in nganhing kingawna mun, biaknatau saksang ah hi biakpiakna ngan kingo tu a, biaknatau pangh li tengah a chi kithe tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thau theampo la in biaknatau tungah kipia tu a, tuate a meithau, a sungthau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a nauta le a tuam thau teng, le a thinsa phabel teng hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna bangin thiampipa in a thau theampo biaknatau tungah hal tu hi. Tua in khialphel biakpiakna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampi innkuanpui, pa peuma in tua sa ne thei tu a, ahizong tua sa thiangtho mama ahikom mun thiangthona ah kine tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna le khialphel biakpiakna ah a kibangin zak tu ngeina khat om a, tua in a sa sia sangaw biakpiakna a pia thiampipa ii neisa hi, cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meihal biakpiakna in a kipia nganhing vun sia biakpiakna a pia thiampipa ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thik bealpeu sungah a ki em, ahibuale beal baannei le moh emna sungah a kivawt antang biakpiakna peuma, Pathian tungah a pia thiampipa ii neisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong a kihuan ngawl antang a kipia theampo, sathau taw a kihel ahizong a kihel ngawl ahizong, Aaron suan thiampite neisa hi a, a kikim in a hawm tek tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nuai a te Topa tungah a kipia kipawlkhop biakpiakna ah zui tu ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat in Pathian tungah lungdamko biakpiakna in hi biakpiakna a vawt le biakpiakna ah a zak tu nganhing taw in, tol saw ngawl anluum piakhawm tu hi, tuate anvui le olive thau a kihel a saa anluumte ahibuale olive thau taw a kizut muhte, ahibuale olive thau taw kihel muhte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua dom ngawlin tol kisaw anluumte zongh pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in anluum nam simin khen khat tek a tuam vilvel in Topa tungah pia tu a; tuate nganhing chi la a, biaknatau tungah a the thiampipa ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakpiakna nganhing sa sia biakpiakna vawt ni in kine tu a; a zingsang ciang dong koi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat in kamciam taangtut natu ahizong ama thinzaw biakpiakna taw ahizong a piak pawlkhop biakpiakna hong paipui le biakpiak ni in ne siat ngawl tu a, a taanglai pawpo a zing ciang ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni thum ni in sa taanglai pawpo kihal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni thum ni in a taanglai sa a kine le tua pa biakpiakna Pathian in saang ngawl tu hi. Tua biakpiakna sia ama atu in phattuamna om ngawl tu a, a thiangtho ngawlin kingaisun in, tua sa a ne pawpo in a piang babang thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua biakpiakna sa sia biakna taw kisai a thiang ngawl khat pawpo taw a kithutha le kine ngawlin a kihal kul tu hi. Biakna zeksa taw kisai in a thiang khat pawpo in tua sa ne thei tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ahizong a thiang ngawl khat pawpo in tua sa a ne le Pathian mi in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in mihing ahibuale nganhing tung pan biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl khat pawpo a tham zawkciang hi biakpiakna sa a ne le, ama sia Pathian mi in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a nuai a, zui tu ngeina teng Israel mite atu in pia hi. Khuithau, tuuthau le kealthau kine ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama thu in a thi thawthong nganhing ahibuale ngamsa ii a mat nganhing sia ii thaute kine ngawl tu a, ahizong na dangin kizangh thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna in a kizangh thei nganhing thau a ne le, ama sia Pathian mi in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koisung po ah a teang zong Israel te in vacim chi le nganhing chi ne ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi thukham a paltan pawpo Pathian ii mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a nuai a, zui tu ngeina teng Israel mite atu in pia hi. A kuama po in kipawlkhop biakpiakna a piak ciang tua ii sung pan pawlkhat sia Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in puak hamtang tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tua letsong sia an taw biakpiakna bangin ama khut vateak taw paipui tu hi. Ama in nganhing thau sia a awmsa taw paipui tu a, Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thiampipa in a thaute biaknatau ah hal tu a, ahizong a awmsa sia thiampite in tang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ziatsang phei bup sia a tuam vilvel letsong in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a chi le a thau taw in kipawlkhop biakpiakna a pia thiampipa tungah pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A awmsa sia a tuam vilvel letsong hi a, a ziatsang phei sia Israel mite tung pan Topa ii a laak, thiampite tungah a piak a tuam vilvel letsong ahi hi. Hisia maisang hun theampo ah Israel mite ii thiampite tungah a piak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hisia in Aaron le a tapate thiampi in a kikipsak ni a, Topa tungah a kipia an sung pan amate a kipia an khen khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ni in hi biakpiakna sung pan khen khat thiampite tungah piak tu in Israel mite tungah Topa in thupia hi. Hi sia in Israel mite ii mai sang hun theampo ah a zui tu ngeina khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, hite in meihal biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna, mawphel biakpiakna, khialphel biakpiakna, kipsakna biakpiaknate, le pawlkhop biakpiakna atu in ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hite sia sennealngam Sinai Mual ah, Israel mite ii zui tu biakpiaknate a vawt natu a son ni in Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiakte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aaron le a tapate ka ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah paipui in, tuaciang thiampi puante, noi sathau, mawphel biakpiak natu in khuital moi sia, tuutal niite le tol saw ngawl anluum khum sia hong paipui ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tualai ah taangpi bup khawm in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin Moses in seam a, taangpi a kikhop uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate tungah Moses in, “Tu in ka sep tu sia, Topa hong thupiak ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a tapate mai sangah paipui a biakna zeksa om bangin, kibualsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses in Aaron laktong le puantual silhsak a, a kawng ah kawngsawmna sawm hi. Ama in ephod silhsak a, a pha mama a kitak kawngkhau taw a kawng sawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in awmdal thuasakin, a tungah Urim le Thummim koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin ama in a lu ah dial khimsak a, a dial mai sangah a thiangtho ki aapna lim, kizepna khamh sia belh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in noi sathau la in Topa ompuina Puanbuk tung le a sungah a om nazak theampo noai siat a, hi bangin Topa tungah aap siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa tungah tua teng aap natu in ama in sathau pawlkhat la in biaknatau tung, a vanh zakte tung, kuang tung le a ngaknate tungah salivei the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Aaron lu tung sathau buakna taw Aaron sia thiampi a hina kipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in Topa thupiak bangin Aaron tapate mai sangah paipui a, laktongte silsakin a kawng uh ah kawngsawmte sawmsakin a lu uh ah lukhute khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in mawphel biakpiak natu in khuital moi sia paipui a, Aaron le a tapate in khui lu tungah a khutte nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua biaknatau aap natu in Moses in tuasia ngo a, a khut taw a chi tawm la in biaknatau kingdokte noai hi. Tuaciang a taanglai chite biaknatau bul ah sung hi. Hi bangin ama in biaknatau aapin thiansua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses in a sungthau theampo, a thinsa a phabel teng le a nauta le a tuam a thau teng la in biaknatau tungah hal siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a taanglai khuital sa teng, a vun, a tak le a ngilpi a ngilzangte la in Topa thupiak bangin ngiaphual pua sangah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Moses in meihal biakpiak natu in tuutal paipui a, Aaron le a tapate in a lu tungah a khutte nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in tua tuu ngo a, biaknatau pangh li tengah a chi the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in Topa thupiak bangin tuusa sem a, a sungkua le a nung peangte tui taw silin, a lu, a thau, le a taanglai tuusa teng biaknatau tungah hal hi. Hi meihal biakpiakna sia an taw biakpiakna hi a, a ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in thiampite a kipsak natu in tuutal a niina sia paipui a, Aaron le a tapate in a lu tungah a khutte nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses in tuutal ngo a, a chi tawm la in Aaron ziatsang bil tung, a ziatsang khutpi tung le a ziatsang peangpi tungah noai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Aaron ii tapate mai ah paipui a, tuutal chi pawlkhat a ziatsang bil tung, a ziatsang khutpi tung le a ziatsang peangpi tung tek ah noai hi. A taanglai chi te Moses in biaknatau pangh li tengah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a thau, a meithau, a sungthau theampo, a thinsa phabel teng, a nauta le a tuam a thau teng le a nung peang ziatsang la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Topa tungah a ki aap khum sung pan tol saw ngawl anluum khat, sathau taw kivawt anluum khat, le moh phang khat la in a thau tung le a nung peang ziatsang tungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in Aaron le a tapate khut tungah hi an teng koi a, amate in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in amate tung pan tua an teng la in kipsakna biakpiakna in nei a, meihal biakpiakna ii tungbel biaknatau tungah hal hi. Hisia in an taw biakpiakna hi a, a ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang Moses in a awmsa la in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia hi. Tua in kipsakna biakpiakna tuutal sa sung pan Moses ii satel ahi hi. Topa thupiak bangin Moses in seam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Moses in noi sathau tawm le biaknatau tungah a om sachi tawm la in, Aaron le a tapate le a puante tungah the hi. Hi bangin amate le a puante Topa tungah aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a tapate tungah, “ Topa thupiak bangin Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah sate paipui in huan vun a, tuaciang khum sungah a om kipsakna biakpiakna anluum taw tualai ah ne vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A sa le anluum neakmongte hal vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kipsakna biakpiakna a zeksa teng a cin mateng ni sali sung Puanbuk kongbiang pan puapial ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na mawna uh a mai natu in Topa thupiak bangin tuni in ih vawt zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin seamin, sun taw zan taw ni sali sung Puanbuk kongbiang ah om hamtang tu nu hi. Na om bua uh le thi tu nu hi. Hi thu in kei tungah Topa hong thupiak ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa ii Moses tungtawnin a thupiakte Aaron le a tapate in tuabangin vawt siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thiampi kipsakna a zeksa teng a man khuavak ni in Moses in Aaron le a tapate le Israel lampuite sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Aaron tungah, “A mealhem ngawl khuital khat le tuutal khat paipui in, Topa tungah pia in a, mawphel biakpiak natu in khuital le meihal biakpiak natu in tuutal hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite tungah mawphel biakpiak natu in kealtal khat, meihal biakpiak natu in a mealhem ngawl kum khat a pha khuino khat le kum khat a pha tuuno khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pawlkhop biakpiakna khat atu in khuital khat le tuutal khat a ken natu son in. Sathau taw a kihel antang taw biakpiakna taw in amate in Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia tu uh hi. Amate in hi teng vawt nanak tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile tuni in amate kungah Topa kilangh tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses thupiak bangin amate in Puanbuk mai ah na theampo paipui a, Topa a bia tu in taangpi bup tua munah kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in, “ Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia no tungah a kilangh thei natu in hi sep tu theampo Topa in note thu hong pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama in Aaron tungah, “Biaknatau ah pai in na mawnate le na mite mawnate a mai natu in, mawphel biakpiakna le meihal biakpiakna pia in. Topa thupiak bangin, mite mawnate a mai natu in hi biakpiakna pia in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron in biaknatau ah pai a, a ma mawphel biakpiakna in khuital moi khat ngo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tapate in sachi puak a, ama in sachi sungah a khutme papin biaknatau king a dok teng sachi pawlkhat noai in, biaknatau bul ah a taanglai teng sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses tungah Topa thupiak bangin Aaron in a thau, a nautate le a thinsa a phabel teng biaknatau tungah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong ama in a satak le a vun sia ngiaphual pua sangah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama ii aituam meihal biakpiakna in ama in ngan ngo hi. A tapate in sachi puakin tuasia biaknatau pangh li tengah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in a lu le a sabek dangte a khut sungah pia a, ama in tua sate biaknatau tungah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a sungkua teng le a nung peangte nii silin biaknatau tung, a om lai meihal biakpiaknate ii tungbel ah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in mipite atu biakpiaknate pia hi. Ama in ama mawphel biakpiakna a vawt bangin mipite mawmai natu in a kipia keal sia kai in ngo a, biakpiakna in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in meihal biakpiak natu in nganno zongh paipui a, ngeina om bangin biakpiakna in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in antang biakpiakna pia a, anvui khutdim khat la in biaknatau tungah hal hi. (Hisia ni sim meihal biakpiakna belapna ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in mipite atu kipawlkhop biakpiakna in khuital le tuutal ngo hi. A tapate in sachi puak a, ama in biaknatau pangh li tengah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron in khuithau le tuutal thaute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nganhingte ii awmsa tungah koi in biaknatau ah paipui siat hi. Ama in biaknatau tungah a thaute halin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses thupiak bangin a awmsate le a nung peang ziatsangte thiampite atu in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aaron in sangaw biakpiakna teng a man ciang mipite tungah a khutte laamin thupha pia a, tua zawkciang tuaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa ompuina Puanbuk sungah Moses le Aaron tum in, hong pusua ciang amate in mipite thupha pia a, Topa ompuina khuavak taang velvol sia mipite tungah kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa in meikuang puak a, biaknatau tungah a om meihal biakpiakna le a thau teng haltum hi. Mipite sia tua meikuang a mu uh ciang au siat a lei maingat in kunsuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron ii tapate Nadab le Abibu in amate mei lakna kuang tek la in a sungah meikam koi a, ngimnamtui helin Topa tungah pia hi. Ahizong tua mei thiangtho ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in tuasia a piak tu in amate thupia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Topa in mei puak a, Topa ompuina munah tua mei in amate kaanghlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Moses in Aaron tungah, “ Topa in ‘Ka na a seamte theampo in ka thianthona zakta tu hi; ka mite tungah ka vaangletna ka pualaak tu hi’ a ci ciang a deina sia, tubang ahi hi,” ci hi. Ahizong Aaron bangma pau ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Aaron pano, Uzziel tapate ahi, Mishael le Elzaphan sam a, amate tungah, “Hi sungah hong pai tavun a, a thiangtho Puanbuk sung pan ngiaphual pua sangah na suapuisealte ii luang pusuapui tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses thupiak bangin amate in a luangte puan taw tunin ngiaphual pua sangah pusuapui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Moses in Aaron le a tapate Eleazar le Ithamar tungah, “Na khuangaina na lakna in sam pot ngawl ahibuale puan balkeak in om heak vun. Tuabang na om uh le, na thi tu uh a taangpi bup tungah Topa thin uuk tu hi. Ahizong Topa ii puak mei taw a kaanghlumte hu in na Israel mipuite theampo in a khuangaina lak thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puanbuk kongbiang nusia heak vun, na nusia uh le na thi tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa ii noi sathau taw a ki aap sate na hi uh hi,” ci hi. Tua ahiciang amate in Moses ci bangin seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nangma le na tapate sapittui ahibuale beer na neak zawk uh ciang kong ompuina Puanbuk sungah tum ngawl tu nu hi; na tum uh le thi tu nu hi. Hi thukham na suan na paalte theampo ii zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in Topa neisa le zak ngengei vanhte sia, biakna taw kisai in a thiangtho le a thiangtho ngawl khentel tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses tungtawn a kong piak thukham theampo note in Israel mite tungah hil nanak tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Aaron le a taanglai a tapa niite Eleazar le Ithamar tungah, “ Topa tungah a kipia ante sung pan a taanglai antang biakpiakna teng la vun a, tol saw ngawl anluum vawtin, biaknatau pangh ah ne vun, banghang ziam cile biakpiakna sia thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thiangtho munah ne vun; tua in Topa tungah a kipia an sung pan hong khensak nangma le na tapate ii tan tu ahi hi. Tua in Topa ii kei tungah hong thupiak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong nangma le na innkuanpuite in thiampite atu a Topa tungah a kituam piak letsong le a sa tel, a awmsa le a pheisate ne thei tu nu hi. Biakna taw kisai a thiangthona mun pawpo ah tua sate ne thei tu nu hi. Tuate Israel mite ii pawlkhop biakpiakna te sung pan hong khensak nangma le na tate tan tu in hong kipia biakpiaknate ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tungah an biakpiakna in a thau a kipiak hun ciang amate in a pheisa le a awmsa paipui tu uh hi. Topa thupiak bangin hi sanamte nangma le na tate neisa hi tawntung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiak natu ahi keal sia ii thu Moses in a dok ciang tua keal, kihal tum zo ci sia he hi. Hi thu hangin Eleazar le Ithamar tungah thin uuk a, ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Banghangin mawphel biakpiakna sa a thiangtho munah ne ngawl nu ziam? Tuasia in a thiangtho mama an hi a, taangpi taangta mawmai natu in Topa ii no hong piaksa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A chi sia Puanbuk thiang sungah a kipaipui ngawl hu in, kong thupiak bangin biakpiakna sate tua munah na neak tu uh ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron in, “Mawphel biakpiakna sa sia tuni in ne hi leng Topa in hong saang tu ziam? Tuni in Topa tungah mipite in mawphel biakpiakna le meihal biakpiakna pia zo napi, kei tungah hi bang a lauhuai nate hong tung lalai hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses sia hi thu a zaak ciang lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite atu a nuai a ngeinate pia hi. Leitung nganhing,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />peangcin kaa a, eakkha zongh a thai pawpo ii sa na ne thei tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahizong kalaohte, sakihte, ahibuale bilpite sa na ne bua het tu uh hi. Tuate a thiang ngawlin ngaisut tu ahi hi; hite eakkha a thai hangin a peangcin kaa ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Voksa ne heak vun. Tuate a thiang ngawlin ngaisut tu ahi hi; Vok sia a peangcin kaa hikale eakkha thai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua nganhingte ii sa ne heak vun, a thite zongh tham heak vun; tuate thiangtho ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tha le hawlip a nei ngasa nam peuma ne thei tu nu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahizong tuisung nganhing, tha le hawlip a nei ngawlte na ne buahet tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi nganhingte a thiang ngawlin ngaisut tu ahi hi. Na ne buahet tu uh a, a thite zongh na tham buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuisung a nungta, tha le hawlip a nei ngawl peuma na ne bua het tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nuai a vacimte: muvanlai, simbu, muthi, mupui; mumeikaa, vaciik, va-ak; kalaoh vacim; tuipiva, hilniang vacimlian, vakaang, tuingumpai, vanungak; vasuangui le bak sate na ne buahet tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Peang luk a nei tha nei lungnote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a leang vakeu theite simngawl po thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khaumaw, khuangbai le sim khaumawte na ne thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong tha nei a, a bokvak nganhing no dang theampo a thiang ngawl het in ngaisut tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kuama po in a nuai a nganhing thite a tham peuma nitak dongin nin tu hi: tuate peangcin nei ahihang a kaa ngawl, eakkha a thai ngawl nganhing theampo le, a peangbom a, peang li nei nganhing theampo ahi hi. Tua nganhing a thite a pua peuma in a puan sawp nanak tu a, ahizong nitak dongin a thiang ngawl hi lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Savokphualte, ngam zunamte, sanchiimte le, thankhik namte a nin in kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi nganhingte ahibuale a thiluangte a tham pawpo nitak dongin a thiang ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi sa a thite na khat pawpo tungah a taak le, a tukna tua vanhte a thiang ngawl hi tu hi. A kizakna taw kisai ngawlin thing, puan, savun, ip cite hisia in huam siat tu hi. Tuasia tui sungah dia tu a, ahizong nitak dongin a thiang ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua sathi luangte leibeal khat sungah a taak le, tua ii sungah a om na theampo a thiang ngawl hi tu a, a beal sutham hamtang tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A kine thei an pawpo tungah tuabang beal sung pan tui a kisung le a nin hi tu a, tuabang beal sungah a om a kidawn thei pawpo nin tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sa thiluangte ii taakna khat pawpo sia thiang ngawl a, lei taw kivawt meibung ahibuale bealpeu sia kiseaktham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi sathi luangte ii a thuthaak dang pawpo a thiang ngawl hi tu a, ahizong tuinaak ahibuale tuibeam sia thiang veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A kiciing tu thaicii tungah sathi luang khat a taak le, tua thaicii thiang veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahizong thaicii sia tui sungah kidia in tua tungah sathi luang khat a taak le tua thaicii thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kine thei nganhing khat a thi le, tuasia a tham pawpo nitak dongin thiang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua nganhing sate a ne a om le, a puan sawp hamtang tu a, ahizong nitak dongin a thiang ngawl hi lai tu hi; tua sathi luang a pua pawpo in a puan sawp hamtang tu hi, ahizong ama sia nitak dongin a thiang ngawl hi lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lei ah a vak nganhing note,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />a awmtaal ahizong, peang li taw a vak ahizong, peang tam mama a neite ahizong ne ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hi sate ne in noma le noma a thiang ngawl kisua heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi a, keima thiangtho ka hikom note zongh na thiangtho uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na Pathian ka hi thei natu in Egypt pan hong pusuapui Topa ka hi hi. Keima thiangtho ka hikom note na thiangtho uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hisia in nganhingte, vacimte, tuisung a nungtate theampo le leitung a vakte theampo taw a kisai thukham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Note in biakna taw kisai a thiang le a thiang ngawl, neak thei le neak thei ngawl nganhingte na khentel thei tu na kidop uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah Israel mite atu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zui tu a nuai a ngeinate pia hi. Numei khat in tha sim nin a nei hunsung bangma in tapa khat a nei zawk ni sali sung sia biakna taw kisai in thiangtho ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni liat ni in a tapa vunteap ki at tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang numei in a chi luanna pan biakna taw kisai in a thiantho dong ni sawmthum le ni thum sung ngak tu hi. Ama in a kithiansuana hun a cin mateng a thiangtho na khat zongh tham thei ngawl tu a, a thiangtho Puanbuk sungah tum ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei khat in tha sim nin a nei hunsung bangma in tanu khat a nei zawk ni sawm le ni li sung biakna taw kisai in thiangtho ngawl hi. Tuaciang a chi luanna pan biakna taw kisai in a thian natu in ni sawmluk le ni luk ngei lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tapa ahizong tanu ahizong nei in a thiansua na hun a cin zawkciang, ama in Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om thiampipa tungah meihal biakpiak natu in kum khat a pha tuuno khat le mawphel biakpiak natu in inn vakhu ahibuale ngam vakhu khat paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thiampipa in Topa tungah tua nu ii a zeksa biakpiakna piaksak tu a, ama thiantho ngawlna teng thiansuana in a zeksa teng vawtsak a, tuaciang ama biakna taw kisai in thiangtho tu hi. Hi thu in numei khat ii a naunei zawkciang a zui hamtang tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Numeinu in tuuno khat a nei zo bua ahile inn vakhu nii ahibuale ngam vakhu nii, meihal biakpiak natu in khat, mawphel biakpiak natu in a dang khat paipui tu a, tuaciang thiampipa in tua nu a thiantho ngawlna pan a thiansua tu in a zeksa teng vawtsak tu a, tuaciang ama biakna taw kisai in thiangtho tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah hi thukhamte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in a vun tungah, a lauhuai vun natna dong a suak thei tu meima khat ahibuale uilut khat ahibuale a tum thei meima khat a nei le, ama sia Aaron suan thiampite kungah kipaipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thiampipa in a meima etsak tu a, a meima sung multe kaangin a meima kiimkot sangin a sa a dum zaw le tua meima sia a lauhuai vun natna hi a, thiampipa in tua pa a nin in thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong tua meima kaangin, a kiimkot zongh dum zaw ngawl a, a multe zongh a kaang buale thiampipa in tua pa ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thiampipa in ni sali ni in en kik tu a, a meimate beak ngawlin, kibang lai in, a ngaisun le a dang ni sali sung ma koituam lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampipa in ni sali ni in en kik tu a, a meima thipin tuasia a beak buale ama sia biakna taw kisai in thiangtho hi ci in thangsak tu hi; tuasia meima thawthong bek hi. Tua pa in a puante sawp tu a, biakna taw kisai in a thiang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong thiampipa in en a, thiang hi ci in a thansak zawkciang a meima a beak le thiampipa kungah kilak kik hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiampipa in en kik tu a, a meima a beak le ama sia a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi. Tua in a lauhuai vun natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in a lauhuai vun natna a nei le tua pa thiampipa kungah kipaipui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thiampipa in en tu hi. A vun tungah meima kaang khat om in, a multe kaang a, a nai a dim le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua meima sia a dam thei ngawl vun natna ahi hi. Thiampipa in tua pa a thiangtho ngawlin thangsak tu a, a thiang ngawl a kimusa hi zo ahikom koituam kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua vun natna beakin a lu pan a peang dong a theng le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thiampipa in en kik tu hi. A pumpi tung bup beak zo in a mu le thiampipa in biakna taw kisai in a thiang in thangsak tu hi. A vun theampo hong kaang ahile ama sia biakna taw kisai in a thiang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahizong a meima balh a kimu po ciang ama sia a thiang ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampipa in en kik tu a, a meima a balhin a mu le a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi. A meima balh sia vun natna cinopna hi a, tua pa sia a thiang ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahizong a meima damin a kaan kik ciang, thiampipa kungah tua pa pai tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thiampipa in en kik tu hi, tua meima a kaang zo le, a ma biakna taw kisai in a thiang hi a, thiampipa in a thiangin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uilut vei khat a dam zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a ma santak kang in ahibuale a san le a kang kithua in, hong tum le thiampipa tungah kilak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thiampipa in en tu a, tua a tum sia, a kiim a vunte sang dum zaw in a sungah a multe a kaang le, thiampipa in ama sia a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi. Tuasia in uilut pan a kipan a lauhuai vun natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong thiampipa in en in a sung a, a multe kaang ngawlin, a kiim a vunte sangin a dum zaw tuan bua a, ahizong daang pian in a mu le thiampipa in ama ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A meima a beak le thiampipa in ama a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu a; ama sia vun natna vei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahizong a meima a ngei bangma hi in a beak tuan buale uilut mapawn hi lel a, thiampipa in ama biakna taw kisai a thiangin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo mei in kaanghin, a sa kaang in ahibuale a san le a kaang a kithua le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />thiampipa in en tu hi. A meima sung multe kaangin, a kiim a vunte sangin a dum zaw le, mei kakna pan a kipan a lauhuai vun natna hi a, thiampipa in tua pa a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahizong a meima santak multe kaang ngawlin, a kiim vunte sangin dumzaw tuan ngawl a, ahizong a daang pian le thiampipa in ama ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sali ni in thiampipa in ama en kik tu a, a meima a beak le vun natna ahikom thiampipa in a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahizong a meima beak ngawlin, kilamdang tuan ngawl a, a daang pian bek ahile a lauhuai vun natna hi ngawl hi. Mei kakna mapawn khat bek ahikom thiampipa in biakna taw kisai in a thiangin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pa ahizong numei ahizong a lu tung ahibuale a kha ah meima a nei ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />thiampipa in en tu hi. A kiim a, a vunte sangin dum zaw in, a sung a multe engin a mal a no le, tua in a lauhuai vun natna hi a, thiampipa in a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thiampipa in a et ciang a kiim a, a vunte sangin a meima dum zaw tuan ngawlin, ahizong ama sung a multe mul dang taw a kibang buale, thiampipa in ama ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thiampipa in ni sali ni in a meima en kik tu a, beak zaw ngawl, a sungah mul eng om ngawlin, a kiim a vunte sangin a dum zaw tuan buale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tua pa in a meima kiim simngawl teng, a sam le a mul meet tu hi. Thiampipa in ama ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ni sali ni in thiampipa in a meima en kik tu a, a meima beak ngawlin a kiim a vunte sang a dum zaw tuan buale thiampipa in ama biakna taw kisai a thiangin thangsak hi tu hi. Tua pa in a puante sawp tu a, ama a thiangtho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahizong a thiang in a thansak zawkciang a meima a beak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />thiampipa in en kik tu hi. A meima a beak le, a mul engte et kul nawn ngawl a; tua pa a thiang ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahizong thiampipa in a meima beak ngawlin, a sung a multe ciidam in po a, a meima a damin a ngaisun le thiampipa in ama biakna taw kisai a thiangin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pa ahizong numei ahizong a vun tungah a kaangpawlte a om le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />thiampipa in en tu hi. Tua munte a kaang philphel ahile, vun mealhem natu bekin a piang hi a; tua pa biakna taw kisai in a thiang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mihing khat a nung sam ahizong, a maisam ahizong a pul hangin tua in ninsak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahizong a lu kolhna ah a san le a kaang a kithua meima a piang le, tua in a lauhuai vun natna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thiampipa in en tu a, a san le a kaang kithua meima a om le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />a lu tungah a lauhuai vun natna vei ahikom thiampipa in ama a thiang ngawlin thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A lauhuai vun natna a veipa in puan ek silh tu a, a sam pot ngawlin, a mai nuaisang teng seal a, “A thiang ngawl, a thiang ngawl ka hi hi!” ci in au tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua natna a vei hun sung a thiang ngawl hi a, midangte taw a kikhualana ngiaphual pua sangah teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Samul ahibuale puanneal puansilh tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />puanneal puanbek, ahibuale samul puan, ahibuale savun, ahibuale savun taw kivawt khat pawpo tungah a pawl a om ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />a hing ahibuale a sanin a beak le thiampipa tung lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Thiampipa in en tu a, tua puan ni sali sung koituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thiampipa in ni sali ni ciang en kik tu a, tua a pawl sia a beak le, tua puan a nin ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Thiampipa in hal tu hi, banghang ziam cile a beak thei ahikom mei taw haltum tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ahizong ama in a ettel ciang, a pawl sia puan tungah kizel ngawlin a mu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />ama in tua puan a sawp natu le a dang ni sali sung a koituam natu in thupia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in en tu a, tua a pawl na ii a pianzia a kilaih buale a kizel bua zong nin veve hi; a pawl te omna mun a nung ahizong a mai ahizong mei taw hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahizong thiampipa in a et ciang a pawl teng a bo zo le, tua puan ahibuale savun sia tua san tak teng eaukeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a pawl te hong piangkik in a kizel kik le a neipa in tua sia hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ama in tua na sia silthiang in a pawlte a bo le, ama in tuasia silthiang kik tu a, biakna taw kisai in a thiang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Hisia in samul ahibuale puanneal ahibuale samul puan, savun taw kivawt na khat pawpo tungah a om a pawlte taw kisai zui tu thukham ahi hi; hisia in biakna taw kisai a thiang le a thiang ngawl khensatna daan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in a lauhuai vun natna pan a dam mihing khat a zeksa thiansua natu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nuai a zui tu ngeinate Moses tungah pia hi. Ama a thiang hi ci in a kithansak tu ni in, thiampipa kungah kipaipui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thiampipa in ngiaphual pua sangah ama paipui in en tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A natna a dam le, thiampipa in biakna taw kisai a thiang vacim nii sia cedar thing, khausan, hyssop meangte taw a kipaipui khop natu in thupia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in vacimte khat ciktui thiang a kidim leibeal khat tungah a thalup natu in thupia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in vacim dang khat sia la in a kithat vacim ii chi sungah cedar thing, khausan le hyssop taw, pap khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in vun natna vei a kithiansua tu pa ii tungah salivei a chi the tu a, tua zawkciang ama thiang hi ci in thiampipa in thangsak tu hi. A nungta vacim sia dui sungah leangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua pa in a puan sawp tu a, a multe theampo meetin kibual tu a, tua zawkciang ama biakna taw kisai in a thiang hi tu hi. Ama ngiaphual sung tum thei tu ahihang, buk pua sangah ama ni sali sung a teen kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni sali ni in ama in a sam, a khamul, a mitmul le a taanglai a pum tung mul teng theampo meet kik siat tu a; a puante silthiang in kibual tu a, tuaciang ama biakna taw kisai in a thiang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni liat ni in kum khat a pha, a mealhem ngawl tuutalno nii le tuu anu khat olive thau taw kihel anvui kilogramme thum le olive thau litre khat ii khenthum sua khenkhat, ama in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thiampipa in tua pa le biakpiaknate Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in sathau litre khat ii khenthum sua khenkhat taw tuutal note khat khialphel biakpiakna in pia tu hi. Ama in thiampipa atu in tua te Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in mawphel biakpiak natu le meihal biakpiak natu in nganhing kingawna mun, a thiangthona munah tuuno ngo tu hi. Ama in hi bangin vawt tu hi, banghang ziam cile khialphel biakpiakna sia mawphel biakpiakna taw kibangin thiampipa ii neisa hi a, thiangtho mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thiampipa in tuuno chi tawm la in, biakna taw kisai a kithiansua pa ii a ziatsang bildawn, a ziatsang khutpi dawn le a ziatsang peangpi dawn noisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampipa in olive thau tawm la in a veisang khutpheak sungah sung tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a ziatsang khutme khat a sungah papin, Topa ompuina tualai ah tua sathau pawlkhat salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a khutpheak sung a om sathau tawm le tuuno chi tawm la in biakna taw kisai thiang hi, ci in a kithangsak tu pa ii a ziatsang bildawn, a ziatsang khutpi, a ziatsang peangpi tungah noai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khutpheak sungah a taanglai sathaute tua pa lu tungah thisak tu hi. Tuabangin thiampipa in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang thiampipa in mawphel biakpiakna pia in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi. Tuasia zawkciang ama in meihal biakpiak natu in ngan ngo tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />antang biakpiakna taw biaknatau tungah pia tu hi. Hi bangin thiampipa in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu a, tua pa biakna taw kisai in thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua pa zawngin a dang bangma a pia zo buale a kithiansua natu bekin, tuutal khat khialphel biakpiak natu, thiampipa atu in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsongin pia tu hi. Ama in antang biakpiak natu in olive thau taw a kihel anvui kilogramme khat le olive thau litre khat ii khenthum sua khenkhat paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in inn vakhu nii ahibuale ngam vakhu nii zongh keng tu a, mawmai biakpiak natu in khat, le meihal biakpiak natu in khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kithiansua zawk ni liat ni in, Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om thiampipa kungah tuate paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thiampipa in tuu le olive thau keng tu a, thiampipa atu in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsongin pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in tuu ngo tu a, a chisan tawm la in tua pa ii ziatsang bildawn, a ziatsang khutpi tung le ziatsang peangpi tungah noai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thiampipa in a veisang khutpheak tungah sathau tawm sung tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a ziatsang khutme taw Topa ompuina tualai ah tua sathau pawlkhat salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in chisan a noina mun tengma ahi, a ziatsang bildawn, a ziatsang khutpi tung le a ziatsang peangpi tungah sathau tawm noai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A khutpheak sungah a taanglai sathau teng sia tua pa lu tungah thisak tu a, hi bangin a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in inn vakhu khat ahibuale ngam vakhu khat sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />mawphel biakpiakna in pia tu a, a dang khat sia meihal biakpiakna in antang biakpiakna taw pia tu hi. Hi bangin thiampipa in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hisia in a kiitakhuai vun natna vei a ahihang ama kithiansua natu in a kisamh biakpiaknate a pia zo ngawl sia ii zui tu thukham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />inn sungah cipawl natna kizel in a om ciang a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. (Hite sia Israel mite ii lua tu in Topa ii a piak tu Canaan ngamsung a tum zawkciang a zak tu ngeinate ahi hi.) Topa in a inn sungah cipawl natna puak hi ci in mihing khat pawpo in a mu le pai in thiampipa tungah son nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thiampipa in cipawlnatna en tu a pai ma in inn sung vanh theampo a pusua natu in thupia tu a; tua ahibuale inn sung vanh teng thiang ngawl hi, ci tu hi. Tuaciang ama sia inn ah pai tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />cipawl natna sittel tu hi. Tuate in ahingpian ahibuale a sanpawl hi a, innpang a nesuk tu bang ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tua inn sia ni sali sung tawkalh cip in ama in nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ni sali ni ciang ama heak kikin sittel kik tu hi. Tua cipawl natna a beak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tua cipawl natna a baanna suangte la in khuapi puasang a ninna munah a vawk natu in thiampipa in thupia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in pang sungsang belna teng kiatsak tu a, a kiatna vuite khuapi pua sang a ninna ah vawksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaciang tua suangte a kilaakna munah suang dangte koi kik tu a, a zutna thak taw zut kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Suangte la in pangte kiat a, za a zut kik zawkciang cipawl natna tua inn sungah hong om kik veve le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />thiampipa in pai in en tu hi. Tua cipawl natna a kizel ahile tua inn a thiang ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua inn phel tu a, a suangte, a thingte le a zutnate khua puasang a ninna munah vawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua inn sia taw a kikalh laitakin a sungah a tum khat pawpo sia nitak dong a thiang ngawl hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hi inn sungah a lum ahibuale an a ne sia in ama puante sawpthiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Thiampipa in inn sia za a kizut zawk in a et ciang cipawl natna a om kik nawn buale, cipawl natna bo thiang zo ahikom ama in biakna taw kisai a thiang inn ci in thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Inn thiansua natu in ama in vacim nii, cedar thing tawm, khausan le hyssop baakno meang khat paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama in cik tuithiang koina leibeal tungah vacimte khat ngo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in cedar thing, hyssop, khausan le a nungta vacim paipui in, a kithat vacim chi sung le tuithiang sungah pap tu hi. Tuaciang ama in tua inn salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hi bangin vacim chi, tuithiang, a nungta vacim, cedar thing, hyssop le khausante taw ama in inn thiansua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in a nungta vacim sia khuapi puasang dui sungah leangsak tu hi. Hi bangin ama in a zeksa inn thiansuana vawt tu a, biakna taw kisai in inn thiang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hiteng sia a kiitakhuai vun natnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />meimate, uilutte ahibuale a tum meimate, le puan tung ahibuale inn sungah cipawl natnate taw kisai zui tu thukhamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hi thukhamte in na khat sia thiang ziam thiang ngawl ziam khensat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite atu in a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. Pasal khat pawpo a zang pan a tui a naai a pusuak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tawlnga ngawlin a luang ahizong, a kikhak ahizong tua sia thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lupna tungah a to ahibuale a lum le tua lupna thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua pa lupna a tham pawpo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahibuale a tona tungah a to pawpo in a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua naai a neipa a tham pawpo in a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua naai a neipa in biakna taw kisai in a thiang khat pawpo cil a phii le tua pa sia ama puan teng sawp in, kibual nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua naai a neipa tona siphukungh ahibuale tokhum sia thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi sia pa tona a tham pawpo nitak dongin thiang ngawl hi. Hi sia pa tona a pua pawpo in ama puante sawp in, kibual nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua naai a neipa in a khut sil masa ngawlin mihing khat po a tham le ama puan teng sawp in kibual nanak tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi sia pa ii a tham leibeal pawpo kisutham tu a, ama thamsa thing taw kivawt kuang pawpo kisilthiang hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua naai a neipa a dam zawkciang ni sali sung ngak tu a, tuaciang a puante sawp in cik tuithiang sungah kibual nanak tu a, tuaciang ama biakna taw kisai in thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni liat ni in ama in inn vakhu nii ahibuale ngam vakhu nii Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah paipui in thiampipa pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampipa in mawphel biakpiakna in khat, meihal biakpiakna in a dang khat pia tu hi. Hi bangin tua pa atu a zeksa thiansuana ama in vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat sia a bawtui a pusuak le a pum bupin kibual tu a, ahizong ama nitak dongin nin veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua bawtui a taakna puan taw ahibuale savun taw kivawt na khat pawpo sia silthiang tu a, ahizong nitak dongin tua na sia nin veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Numei le pa omkhopna a nei zawkciang a nii in kibual nanak tu a, ahizong amate nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei khat tha sim nin a nei ciang ama ni sali sung thiang ngawl hi. Tua nu a tham pawpo nitak dongin thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua numei ii a nin nei sung a tona ahibuale a lupna sia thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama lupna ahizong a tona ahizong a tham pawpo in ama puante silthiang in kibual tu a, ahizong nitak dongin ama nin veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pa khat in numei khat a nin nei sungin a omkhoppui le tua pa niinsak a, ni sali sung thiang ngawl hi, tua ciang a lupna pawpo zongh thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei khat tha sim a nin nei zawkciang ni tam mama sung a chi a luang le, ahibuale numei nin nei ngei hun sangin a chi luan hun a tamzaw le, nin a nei hunsung teng bangma in a chi luan laiteng tua nu sia nin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nin nei hun sungin a lupna le a tona pawpo sia nin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate a tham pawpo nin a, a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu a; ahizong ama nitak dongin thiang ngawl veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A chi luan a kan zawkciang ama in ni sali ngak tu a, tuaciang ama biakna taw kisai in thiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ni liat ni in ama in inn vakhu nii ahibuale ngam vakhu nii Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om thiampipa kungah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thiampipa in mawphel biakpiakna in khat le meihal biakpiakna in a dang khat pia tu a, hi bangin ama in tua nu a zeksa kithiansuana vawtsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngiaphual laizang ah a om Topa ompuina Puanbuk a nitsak ngawl natu in Israel mite tungah a thiantho ngawlna taw kisai in, a kidopna tu thu a son tu in Topa in Moses thupia hi. A ninsak ahile amate kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiteng sia, a zang pan naai a pusuak pa khat ahibuale a bawtui a luang pa khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />numei khat tha sim a nin nei hunsung ahibuale, biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl numei khat taw a khialpa ii zui tu ngeinate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah a thiangtho ngawl mei taw biakpiakna a piak ciang a kithat Aaron tapate nii thi zawkciang Topa in Moses paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Thiangtho Bel Mun sung puankhai ii nungah a hun lian ciang a tum natu in na suapuipa Aaron son in, banghang ziam cile tua mun sia Thuciamna Thingkuang sitna tung meei sungah ka kilaakna mun ahi hi. Tua thu a ni buale ama kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mawphel biakpiakna in khuitalno khat le meihal biakpiakna in tuutal khat a paipui zawkciang bek in Thiangtho Bel Mun ah tum thei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. Aaron, Thiangtho Bel Mun ah a pai ma in kibual nanak tu a, thiampi puante: puanneal puantual silhin, ngoaipuan tom teang tu a, kawngkhau sawm in dial khim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel taangpite in mawphel biakpiak natu in kealtal nii le meihal biakpiak natu in tuutal khat Aaron tungah pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aaron in ama mawna le a innkuanpuite mawna a mai natu in khuital khat sangaw biakpiakna in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah keal nii paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualai ah, “ Topa atu” ci a, a kiciamtee suang khat le “Azazel atu” ci in a kiciamtee suang dang khat, suang nii zanghin ama in lai meetang sawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa atu in meetang taw a teal kealtal khat sia Aaron in mawphel biakpiakna in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azazel atu a kiteal keal sia a nungta in Topa tungah pia tu a, mipite mawmai natu in sennealngamsung Azazel kungah paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aaron in ama le a innkuanpuite atu mawphel biakpiakna in khuital a piak ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in biaknatau pan meikam kuang khat dim le ngimnamtui phate khutdim nii la tu a, Mun Thiangtho Bel ah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualai Topa ompuina munah ama in ngimnamtui sia mei tungah koi tu a, a khu in Thuciamna Thingkuang sitna sia seal tu hi, tua hile ama in tuasia mu ngawl tu a, thi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in khuital chi tawm la tu a, a khutme taw a sitna mai teng the in, tuaciang Thuciamna Thingkuang mai teng salivei the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, ama in mipite mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal ngo tu a, Thiangtho Bel Mun ah a chi paipui in khuital chi a the bangma, a sitna tung le Thuciamna Thingkuang mai teng the tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel mite ii thiantho ngawlna le mawna theampo ii nitsakna panin Thiang Bel Mun sia a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi. Biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl ngiaphual laizang ah tua Puanbuk om ahikom Aaron in Puanbuk sia tuabangin a thiansua kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiangtho Bel Mun ah a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu in Aaron a tum pan kipan a pusua kik dong, Puanbuk sungah kuama om ngawl tu hi. Ama atu, a innkuanpuite atu le Israel taangpi bup atu a zeksa teng a vawt zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />meihal biakpiakna pia tu le biaknatau thiansua tu in biaknatau ah ama pai tu hi. Ama in khuital chi tawm le keal chi tawm la in biaknatau king a dokna teng noai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a khutme taw sachi pawlkhat biaknatau tung salivei the tu hi. Hi bangin ama in tua biaknatau Israel mite mawna pan thiansua in, thiangthosak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aaron in Thiangtho Bel Mun le Topa ompuina Puanbuk sung mundang teng le biaknatau atu in a zeksa thiansuana a vawt zawkciang, Azazel atu in a kiteal keal nungta lai sia Topa tungah pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in tua keal lu tungah a khutte nii nga tu a, Israel mite siatna, mawna le leedona teng theampo pualaak in, tuabangin keal lu tungah suan siat tu hi. Tua zawkciang tua keal sia tuabang a seam tu, a kisep pa in sennealngam sungah beng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua keal in kuama teen ngawlna ngam sungah amate mawna theampo pua in paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Puanbuk sungah Aaron tum tu a, Thiangtho Bel Mun sung a tum ma in a silh thiampi puan teng suutin tua munah nusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in mun thiangtho ah kibual tu a, ama puante silh tu hi. Tua zawkciang pusuak in ama mawna le mite mawna teng a mai natu in meihal biakpiakna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in mawphel biakpiak natu in nganthau sia biaknatau tungah hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sennealngam sung Azazel kungah keal a beng pa in ngiaphual ah hong cia kik ma in a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiak natu in a kizangh khuital le keal ii chi, mawmai natu in Thiangtho Bel Munah a kipaipui sia ngiaphual pua sangah paipui in kihal tu hi. A vun, a sa le a ngilzangte theampo kihal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hal pa ngiaphual hong heak kik ma in a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nuai a ngeinate maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi. A tha salina, ni sawm ni in Israel te le a teen khoppui ngamdangmite in an tang tu a, na seam ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni in biakna taw kisai in a thian natu in amate mawna theampo a thiansua tu in a zeksa teng vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ni sia a thiangtho mama ni khat hi tu a, tua ni in an tang tu a, na seam ngawl tu hi. Hi ngeinate maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pa za a laih tu in thupha piak kipsakna a vawtsak sa le a ki aap sa, Thiampi Lianbelpa in a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu hi. Ama in thiampi puante silh tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thiangthobel Mun Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk a taanglai teng, biaknatau, thiampite le taangpi taangta theampo, thiansua natu in a zeksa teng vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi ngeinate maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi. Israel mite mawna theampo thiansua natu in hi zeksa ngeina sia kum khat in khatvei kivawt hamtang tu hi. Tuabangin Moses in Topa thupiak bangin seam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah Aaron le a tapate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />le Israel mite theampo tungah a nuai a zui tu ngeinate a piak tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel te khat in khui khat ahibuale tuu khat ahibuale keal khat Topa tungah biakpiakna khat bangin Topa ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang simngawl mundang ah a ngo le, Thukham paltan zo hi. Ama in chisan luangsak zo ahikom Pathian mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thupiak ii a khiakna sia tu in Israel mite ii ngam sungah a ngaw bul ngannote Topa kungah paipui tu cinopna ahi hi. Amate in tu in tua ngannote Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om thiampipa kungah paipui tu a, pawlkhop biakpiakna in ngo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampipa in Puanbuk kongbiang ah a om biaknatau pangh tengah a chi the tu a, a thau sia Topa ii a lungkim ngimnamtui a piangsak tu in hal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite in Topa tungah hong thumaan in, lo sung keal doaite biakna in sa ngo nawn ngawl tu hi. Israel mite in maisang hun theampo ah hi ngeina zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel khat ahibuale a teen khoppui ngamdangmi khat pawpo in meihal biakpiakna ahizong a dang biakpiakna ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa tungah biakpiakna a piak ciang Puanbuk kongbiang simngawl mundang ah a pia le, Pathian mi khat in kituat nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel te khat pawpo ahibuale a teen khoppui ngamdangmi khat pawpo in a sungah chi om lai sa a ne le, Topa in ama nungngat tu a, ama mi in sim nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nungta theampo ii nuntakna sia chi sungah om hi, tua ahikom mihingte mawmai natu in chi theampo biaknatau tungah a kisun natu Topa thupiak ahi hi. Nuntakna a hi chisan in mawna teng lakeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi hu in, amate ahizong a teen khoppui ngamdangmite khat pawpo ahizong, a sungah chi om lai sa pawpo a neak ngawl natu in Topa in Israel mite tungah son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel te khat pawpo ahibuale a teen khoppui ngamdangmi khat pawpo in biakna taw kisai a thiang nganhing khat ahibuale vacim khat a man le ama in a chi lei ah sung nanak tu a lei huk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nungta theampo ii nuntakna sia chi sungah om ahi hu in a sungah chi om lai sa pawpo a neak ngawl natu in, Israel mite tungah Topa in son zo a, a ne pawpo ama mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel te ahibuale ngamdangte khat pawpo in ama thu in a thi thawthong nganhing khat ahibuale ngamsa ii a mat khat ii sa a ne le, a puante sawp in kibual nanak tu a, biakna taw kisai in a thian mateng nitak dong ngak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabang a vawt buale thupiangte a thuak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite a sonsawn tu in Moses tungah, “Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na om ngeina uh Egypt mite omziate ahizong ahibuale tu in note kong paipuina Canaan ngamsung a teang mihingte ii omziate ahizong zui heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thukhamte zui in kong thupiakte seam vun. Keima in Topa noma Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sep tu kong sawl te seam vun a, kong piak thukhamte zui vun; tuabang na hina uh taw na nuntakna na hu tu uh hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. Na mealheakte khat pawpo taw omkhop khialna vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na nu taw numei le pa khialna vawtin na pa maizum pia heak in. Na nu maimawlsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pa zino dangte khat pawpo taw numei le pa khialna vawtin na pa maizum pia heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inn khat sungah khangkhawm na hi uh zong, na hi bua uh zong, na suapuinu ahibuale na suapuisealnu taw numei le pa khialna vawt heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na tunu taw numei le pa khialna vawt heak in; na maizum natu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na suapuisealnu taw numei le pa khialna vawt heak vun, ama zongh na suapuinu ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na pa suapuinu ahibuale na nu suapuinu taw omkhop khialna vawt heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa suapuipa ii zi khialpui heak in; ama zongh na nu khat ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tapa zi khialpui heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na suapuipa zi khialpui heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khialpui nu ii tanu ahibuale a tunu khialpui heak in; na mealheakte ma hi a, chi kinai omkhop khialna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na zi nuntak laiteng na zi tu in na nuphal nu la heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei khat nin a nei laitak omkhoppui heak in, banghang ziam cile ama biakna taw kisai in thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngual zi khialpui heak in; na khialpui le biakna taw kisai in hong ninsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Molech pathian biakna ah zak tu in na tate khat zongh pia heak in, banghang ziam cile tua in Topa ahi Pathian ii min daisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pa le pa omkhop khialna vawt heak in; Pathian in ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa ahizong numei ahizong kuama in nganhing taw omkhop khialna vawt heak hen; tuabang khialna in biakna taw kisai in no hong ninsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi ngamtatnate taw a thiang ngawl kisua tawm heak vun, hi ngam na thet ma a, a teangsa doai biate in hi bangin amate kininsak ahikom noma tum thei natu in Topa in bengkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate ngamtatna in ngam le lei ninsak ahikom Topa in leitang daan pia in tualai ah a teang mite leitang in nialsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in hi bang a kiihuainate taw a leitang ninsak uh a, ahizong note tuabang na hi bua het tu uh hi. Note theampo, Israel te ahibuale no taw teang khawm ngamdangmite in Topa thukhamte le thupiakte zui hamtang tu nu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tua hile note mai ah a teang doai biate leitang ii a nial bangin, no hong nial ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi bangza in a thasiathuai in a ngamta peuma sia Pathian mi khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu a hina thu na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in, “Kong thupiakte zui in hi ngam le lei ah note mai a teang masate ii ngamtat luheaknate na zui heak vun a, hi bang khat pawpo vawtna taw na kininsak heak vun. Keima in Topa note ii Pathian ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel taangpite tungah a sonsawn tu in Moses tungah, “Thiangtho vun, banghang ziam cile Keima Topa na Pathian thiangtho khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kong thupiak bangin note in na nu le na pa zakta vun a, Sabbath tang vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei hong taisan in milim bia heak vun; pathiante thik taw vawt tawm in bia heak vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kipawlkhop biakpiak natu in nganhing na ngaw uh ciang kong piaksa ngeinate zui vun, tua hile tua biakpiakna kong saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa na ngaw uh sia na ngaw ni ahibuale a zing ciang na neak nanak kul hi. Ni thum ni in a taanglai sa pawpo kihal tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tua sa in biakna taw kisai in nin a, a ne a om le tua biakpiakna kong saang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuasia a ne pawpo sia in ka tungah hong ki aap ante nadang thawthong bang suaksak ahikom mawnei suak a, keima mihing khat in kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na lo ante na laak uh ciang lo kiil ah ante la heak vun, na nusiatsa ante a la tu in pai kik heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na makngil uh sapit bom ahibuale lei ah a taak sapitngate tawm kik tu in, pai kik heak vun; tuate mizawngte le ngamdangmite atu in nusiat vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nguta heak vun a, ngualtheam ahibuale leilot thu son heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na zui ngawl tu po ka min taw kamciam pia heak vun; tua in ka min daisak hi. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Noma meet natu in midangte vanh suttol heak vun. Noma cial sa mihing khat ii thamante, zan khat bek zongh khak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangongte haamsiat heak vun a, mittawte lutu natu in a mai ah na khat zongh koi heak vun. Kei hong kiita tavun; keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zum tung thusonnate na khen uh ciang “Thumaan le thutang taw thu khen vun; mizawngte ngum tuan heak vun, ahibuale sumhaute kiita heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khat pawpo taw kisai in leilot thu sonsawn heak vun a, mihing khat ii nuntakna le thina thu a kison ciang na tetti panna in ama a hu thei tu a ahile, son khe in. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihing khat pawpo ngimhuat heak vun, ahizong ama hangin na maw na khial ngawl natu in na kithukim ngawl nate ama taw maitang kisi in pha tak son zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuama tungah phula heak vun a, kuama ngaimaw top heak vun. Noma le noma na ki it uh bangin na innpaamte it vun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kong thupiakte zui vun. Inn ah khoai ngannote nam dang taw ta neisak heak vun. Lo khat sungah thaicii nam nii ciing heak vun. Puan nam nii taw a kivawt puan silh heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mi khat ii a zino ahi ama sila nu sia a kitan sa a suakta sa hi ngawl lai in, midang khat in a khialpui le a nii in daan pia tu a, ahihang a thu kikan ngawl tu a, tua nusia a sila khat ahi hu in amate kithatlum ngawl tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua pa in ama khialphel biakpiak natu in ka ompuina Puanbuk kongbiang ah tuutal khat hong paipui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />thiampipa in a khialphel natu in tua tuutal taw a zeksa thiansuana vawt tu a, Pathian in ama khialna maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Canaan ngam sungah tumin thingno kung nam khat pawpo na suan uh ciang a masa kum thum sung tua thingngate biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawlin ngaisun vun. Tua hun sung teng tua thingnga ne heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kum lina ciang thingnga theampo, Keima na Topa tungah na lungdamna a lak biakpiakna in nong aap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong a kum ngana ciang tua thingnga ne thei tu nu hi. Tuabang na hi uh le na thingno te in nga tamzaw nga tu hi. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Chisan a om lai sa ne heak vun. Mitbum aisaanna tuatuamte zangh heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mithite atu khuangai in na pangh samte meet heak vun, ahibuale na khamul meet heak vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ahibuale noma le noma thulkawng sun ahibuale na taksa kiliamsua heak vun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Na tanute biakinn ah pumpi kizuakna taw a min daisak heak vun; tuabang na hisak uh le pathian dangte sang ah a pial na hi tu uh a, ngamsung teng numei le pa paktatna taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sabbath tang vun a, keima nong biakna mun zakta vun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mithisate ii thaate thu a dongh thei te kungah thu dongh tu in pai heak vun. Na pai uh le, note biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl na hi tu uh hi. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Khanghaamte zatakna lak vun a, upat vun. Keima hong thasia in ka thu ni vun; keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Noma ngam sungah hong teang ngamdangmite vawtsia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na lawm Israel te na vawt uh bangin vawt vun a, noma na ki it uh bangin amate it vun. Khatvei lai in Egypt ngam ah ngamdangmi na hina thu phawk vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“A man ngawl a sauna, a ngitna ahibuale a phakza teena taw khat pawpo theam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A man pikhau, toaisuang le khaikhin zangh vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi a, Egypt pan kong pusua pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thukhamte le kong thupiakte theampo zui vun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite tungah hi bang a sonsawn tu in Moses tungah, “Note khat pawpo ahibuale note taw a teang khawm ngamdangmi khat pawpo, Molech pathian biakna in a zak tu in a ta a pia pawpo sia, taangpi in suang taw deanglum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo a tate khat Molech tungah pia in, ka Puanbuk thiangtho ninsak a, ka min thiangtho a daisak le ka nungngat tu a, ka mi khat in ka ngaisun nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong tua pa ngamtatna taangpite in awlmawk ngawlin a thatlum bua le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua pa, a innkuan bup le Molech bia in ka tungah hong thumaan ngawl theampo ka nungngat tu hi. Amate ka mi in ka ngaisun nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mithite ii thaate tungah thu a dongh thei mihingte kungah mi khat pawpo pai in thu a dongh le ama ka nungngat tu a, ka mi khatin ka ngaisun nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note thiangtho tavun, banghang ziam cile keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thukhamte hong zui tavun, banghang ziam cile Keima in Topa hi a, kong thiangthosak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. A nu le a pa a haamsiat peuma kithatlum tu hi; ama ii thina sia ama kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi khat in Israel mipui khat ii zi a khialpui le a nii in kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi khat in a pa zite khat a khialpui le a pa maimawlsak hi a, a nii in kithatlum tu hi. Amate thina in amate kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat in a tapa zi a khialpui le a nii in kithatlum tu hi. Mealheak kuung sung numei le pa omkhop khialna vawt ahiciang amate thina in amate kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa khat in a dang pa khat taw a khial le a kiihuai ngamtatna hi a, a nii in kithatlum tu hi. Amate thina in amate kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat in numei khat le tua nu ii nu a teenpui le a thum in kihallum tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a min daihuai ngamtatnate vawt uh hi; note sungah hi bang ngamtatnate omsak ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi khat in nganhing taw a khial le, a nii in kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Numei khat in nganhing khat taw khial nuamin a hanciam le a nii in kithatlum tu hi. Amate thina in amate kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat in a suapuinu ahibuale a suapuisealnu a teenpui le, amate mipite mai ah a maizumhuai le a thasiathuai in kivawt tu a, a mihuam sung pan kihawlkhia tu hi. A suapuinu khialpui ahikom a piang bang a thuak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi khat in numei khat a nin nei laitak a khialpui le a nii in a mihuam sung pan kihawlkhia tu hi, banghang ziam cile biakna sang pan a thiang ngawl thu taw kisai ngeinate paltan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khat in a ni taw a khial le, mealheak kuung ahi hu in a piang bang a nii in a thuak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi khat in a pa suapuipa zi taw a khial le, a pa suapuipa maimawlsak hi a, a nii in daan thuak tu a; tasel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat in a suapuipa zi a teenpui le, tasel in amate thi tu hi. Ama in biakna taw kisai a thiang ngawl na seam hi a, a suapuipa maimawlsak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Kong paipuina Canaan leitang ii note hong nial ngawl natu in ka thukham le ka thupiakte theampo zui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualai ah a teang mite ii ngeinate zui heak vun; hi ngamsung na tum thei natu in hi ngam pan tua doai bia te not keak tu khi hi. A ngamtat siatnate in hong thasiasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahizong hi ngamhoi ngampha lua tu in, hong ciam zo ka hi ciang kong pia tu hi. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi a, minam dangte sung pan kong tuamkoi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua hi a, nganhing le vacimte biakna taw kisai in a thiang le a thiang ngawl na khentel tu uh hi. A nin ahi nganhing le vacimte ne heak vun. Nin hi ka ci sa hi a, na ne uh le a nin hong suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note na thiangtho tu uh a, keima neisa bek na hi tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile keima in Topa ka hi a, ka thiangtho hi. Keima neisa bek na hi thei natu in minam dangte sung pan kong tuamkoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Pa ahizong nu ahizong mithisate thaa tung thu a dongh peuma suang taw kideanglum tu hi; hi bang a ngamta pawpo ama ii thina in ama kivawt ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron suan thiampite tungah a son tu in Topa in Moses thupia a, “Thiampi peuma sia a nu, a pa, a tapa, a tanu, a suapuinu, a suapuipa le inn ah a om pasal nei ngawl a suapuinu a thi ciang simngawl a dang mealheak khat mithi vuina ah a kihelna hu in, biakna taw kisai in a nin kisua heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kiteenna hu in a kinai pui a mealheak te a thi ciang mithi sungah a kihel hu in ama le ama kininsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thiampi peuma khuangaina lakna in a sam mun khat zongh meet ngawl tu a, a khamul zongh tan ngawlin, a ci tung kiliamsua ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama thiangtho tu a, ka min daisak ngawl het tu hi. Ama in an taw biakpiaknate hong pia ahiciang ama a thiangtho kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thiampi khat in pumpi kizuak ngei numei khat, ngaknu thiangtho ngawl, ahibuale pasal ii khul numei khat teenpui ngawl tu hi; ama thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite in thiampipa a thiangtho in ngaisun tu hi, banghang ziam cile an taw biakpiaknate kei tungah hong pia hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi; keima ka thiangtho a, ka mite ka thiangthosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiampipa tanu khat pumpi kizuak numei a suak le, a pa maimawlsak hi; ama kihallum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A lu tung sathau buak sa le thiampi puan silh tu in a ki aapsa Thiampi Lianbel khat in khuangaina lakna in a sam pot ngawlin, a puante balkeak in om ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama kei tungah hong ki aapsa ahiciang biakna taw kisai a thiangtho ngawl kisuaksak heak hen a, a nu a pa tatak thi le zong ka Puanbuk nusia in mithi koina inn ah a tum hu in a thiangtho ka Puanbuk ninsak heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in ngaknu thiangtho khat teenpui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />meingong ahibuale pasal taw kikhen sa numei, ahibuale pumpi kizuak ngei numei teenpui ngawl tu hi. Ama suante sung pan ngaknu thiangtho bekma teenpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabang ahibuale a thiangtho tu a tate sia biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl suak tu hi. Keima in Topa hi a, ama sia Thiampi Lianbel in ka koituam zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Moses ii
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aaron tungah a son tu in a thupiakna pan, “Na suan na paal sung pan pumpi mealhemna khat pawpo a neite in ka tungah an taw biakpiakna hong pia heak hen. Hi thu in maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pumpi mealhem peuma in biakpiakna pia thei ngawl tu hi, tuate in mittaw, peangbai, mealhem ahibuale pumpi sitbaang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khutkon peangkon te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cingkuul ahibuale mihing khansamh te; mit natna nei ahibuale vun natna nei; cil kingette ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thiampi Aaron suan pumpi mealhemte in kei tungah an taw biakpiakna hong pia thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabang mihing khat in ka tungah hong kipia biakpiakna, a thiangtho biakpiakna le a thiangtho mama biakpiakna ante ne thei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahizong ama pumpi sitbaang ahikom a thiangtho puankhai kungah pai ngawl tu a, ahibuale biaknatau neak ngawl tu hi. Ama in hi a thiangtho nate ninsak ngawl het tu hi, banghang ziam cile Keima in Topa ka hi a, amate ka thiangthosak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi thu Moses ii Aaron, Aaron ii tapate le Israel mite theampo tungah a son thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses ii Aaron le a tapate a son tu in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />thupia a, “Ka min thiangtho na daisak ngawl het natu in Israel mite ii ka tungah hong aaptuam a thiangtho biakpiaknate ciliap tavun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na suan na paal khat po in biakna taw kisai a thian ngawl laitak, Israel mite ii ka tungah hong aaptuam a thiangtho biakpiaknate nai ah hong pai in ahile biaknatau ah naseam kik thei ngeingawl tu hi. Hisia maisang hun theampo ah a kizangh tu ahi hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aaron suan le paalte sung pan a kiitakhuai vun natna veite, ahibuale meima naai neite in biakna taw kisai in a thiantho mateng a thiangtho biakpiakna ante ne ngawl tu hi. Thiampi khat pawpo in mithiluang taw a kithutha a nin khat pawpo, ahibuale bawtui a tee pa khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahibuale a thiang ngawl nganhing, ahibuale mihing khat a tham le ama thiang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiampi khat pawpo a thiang buale nitak dongin a nin hi tu a, a kibual mateng a thiangtho biakpiakna ante ne thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nitum zawkciang ama thiang a, tuaciang ama an ahi a thiangtho biakpiakna ante ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, ama thu in a thi thawthong nganhing ii sa ahibuale ngamsa ii thalup sate ne ngawl tu hi; tua in ama ninsak tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thiampi theampo in kong piaksa ngeinate zui tu hi. Tuabang a zui bua uh le amate a maw hi tu a thi tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a thiangtho ngeinate a zui ngawl hang ahi hi. Keima in Topa ka hi a, amate ka thiangthosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Thiampi innkuanpuite bek in a thiangtho biakpiakna an pawpo ne thei tu a; kuama dang — thiampi taw a omkhawm khat, ahibuale a thacial khat zongh in ne thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong ama ii sum taw a lei silate ahibuale tualsuak silate in thiampi ii a nga ante ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thiampi khat ii tanu in thiampi ahi ngawl khat a teenpui le a thiangtho biakpiakna an khat pawpo ne thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong thiampi khat ii tanu sia a pasal thi in meingong, ahibuale ta nei ngawlin a pasal in khul a, a pa inn ah bealhin a cia kik le a pa ii nga thiampi ante ne thei tu hi. Thiampi innkuanpuite bek in hi ante ne thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thiampi innkuanpui ahi ngawl khat in a thiangtho biakpiakna ante a heak ngawlin a ne tha le ama in thiampipa tungah a man a cingin liau kik tu a, zakhat ciang kul taw belap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thiampite in tua ante a ne thei ngawl tu midang khat pawpo a neaksakna taw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a thiangtho biakpiakna ante ninsak ngawl tu hi; a ninsakte a maw hi tu a, daan thuak tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi a, biakpiaknate ka thiangthosak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate le Israel mite theampo ii zui tu in a nuai a ngeinate a piak tu in thupia hi. Israel mite khat pawpo in ahibuale Israel sung a teang ngamdangmi khat pawpo in meihal biakpiakna a piak ciang, kamciam taangtutna in a piak ahizong, thinzaw biakpiakna taw a piak ahizong, a mealhem ngawl nganhing zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kisaang thei tu in, a mealhem ngawl a tal hi nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A mealhem nganno khat po na pia le Topa in saang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat pawpo in kipawlkhop biakpiakna Topa tungah a piak ciang, kamciam taangtutna, ahibuale thinzaw biakpiakna a piak ciang, Topa ii saan thei tu in a mealhem ngawl nganhing hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa tungah a mittaw, a peangbai, a mealhem, meima vei, vun meima balh, a khiik nei meima vei nganhing khat pawpo pia heak vun. Hi bang nganhingte biaknatau ah an biakpiakna in pia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thinzaw biakpiakna ah a khansamh ahibuale a limci tatak ngawl nganhingte pia thei tu nu hi, ahizong kamciam taangtut natu in tuate kisaang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ciltang a tamhsa, a kingetsa, a kisuthamsa, a kilakeaksa nganhing khat pawpo Topa tungah pia heak vun. Hite sia na ngam sungah zak tu ki oai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngamdangmite tung pan a kinga nganhing taw an biakpiakna pia heak vun. Hi bang nganhingte a sitbaang in kingaisun a, kisaang thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khui, tuu, kealte a no a sua ciang ni sali sung a pui taw na khen buatu uh hi, ahizong tua zawkciang an biakpiakna in kisaang thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ni khat sungin khuipui le a no, tuupui le a no, kealpui le a no, sangaw biakpiakna in piakhawm heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko biakpiakna na piak uh ciang hong san thei tu in ngeinate zui vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tua ni in a sa ne in, a khuavak ni zingsang dong bangma khe heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka thupiakte zui vun; Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka min thiangtho daisak heak vun; Israel mite theampo in thiangtho ka hina hong saan kul hi. Keima in Topa ka hi a, note kong thiangthosak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />na Pathian ka hi natu in Egypt pan note kong pusuapui hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite ii a biak kikhop ciang, biakna poaite atu in a zui tu a nuai a ngeinate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in na nasep natu in ni luk sung nei nu hi, ahizong ni sali ni, Sabbath sia tawlngakna ni ahi phawk vun. Tua ni in naseam heak vun, ahizong biakpiakna vawt tu in kikhawm vun. Koisung po na teang uh zong Sabbath sia Topa neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kisee hun a tun simin a nuai a poaite thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa patoaina in a kivawt Paisan Poai sia tha masabel ni sawm le ni li ni, nitum ciang kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sawm le ni nga ni in Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai kipan a, ni sali sung tol kisaw anluum peuma na ne buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Poai sung ni masabel ni in biakna vawt tu in na kikhawm tu uh a, kuama in noma ii ni sim nasep bangma seam ngawl het tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni sali sung Topa tungah an taw biakpiaknate pia vun. A ni sali ni in biakna vawt tu in kikhawm kik vun, ahizong kuama in noma ni sim nasep bangma seam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa hong piakna ngam thengin an na laak uh ciang anpal taangvawng sia thiampipa pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No hong kisaan thei natu in thiampipa in Topa tungah tuasia a tuam vilvel biakpiakna in pia tu hi. Tuasia Sabbath khuavak ni in thiampipa in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Antang biakpiakna na piak ni in meihal biakpiakna in a mealhem ngawl kum khat a pha tuutal khat zongh na pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua taw an biakpiakna in olive thau taw a kihel anvui kilogramme nii na pia tu uh hi. Hi biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi. Biakpiakna in sapittui litre khat zongh pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian tungah hi biakpiakna na piak uh mateng anthak peuma, a sial, a kan ahibuale anluum em ne heak vun. Hi ngeina sia na suan le na paalte theampo ii maisang hun theampo ah a zui tu ngeina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa tungah anpal na piak ni, Sabbath khuavak ni pan nipi sali a cin dong simto vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabbath salivei a cin zawk ni sawmnga ni in Topa tungah a dang antang biakpiakna thak pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Innkuan simin anluum lum nii tek keng tu a, a tuam vilvel letsong in Topa tungah pia tu hi. Anluum khat sia anvui kilogramme nii tol kisaw in a ki em hi tu a, laak pheang tu anpal biakpiakna in Topa tungah pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua anluum taw taangpite in a mealhem ngawl kum khat a pha, tuuno sali, khuital khat le tuutal nii pia tu uh hi. Tuate Topa tungah meihal biakpiakna in antang biakpiakna le sapittui biakpiakna taw kipiakhawm tu hi. Hi biakpiakna ii ngimnam in Topa lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawphel biakpiakna in kealtal khat le kipawlkhop biakpiakna in kum khat a pha tuutalno nii zongh pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thiampipa in thiampite atu in Topa tungah a tuam vilvel letsong in anluum sia tuunote nii taw pia tu hi. Hi biakpiaknate thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ni in kuama in noma ii ni sim nasep bangma seam heak vun, ahizong biak kikhopna nei vun. Koisung po ah na teang uh zong na suan na paalte in hi ngeina sia maisang hun theampo ah zui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na lo ante na laak uh ciang lomong a om ante la heak vun a, na nusiat sa ante at kik tu in pai kik heak vun; tuate sia mizawngte le ngamdangmite atu in nusia vun. Topa sia na Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tha salina ni masabel ni sia a tuam vilvel tawlngakna ni in tang vun a, lemle hong kitum ciang biakna vawt tu in kikhawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna pia vun a, noma ii ni sim nasep bangma seam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tha salina ni sawm ni sia mite mawmai natu in kumcin biakna a zeksa sep ni tu ahi hi. Tua ni in bangma ne heak vun a; biak kikhopna ah pai tekin Topa tungah an taw biakpiakna pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ni in naseam heak vun, banghang ziam cile tua ni sia mawna a mai natu a zeksa sep ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ni in an khat pawpo a ne sia, Pathian mi khatin kingaisun nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni in na seam a om le Topa ama mama in thisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Koisung po ah a teang zong hi ngeina sia na suan na paalte theampo atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua tha ni kua ni nitum pan kipan ni sawm ni nitum dong sia a tuam vilvel tawlngakna ni in na tan tu uh hi a, tua hun sungin bangma kine thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Buk poai sia tha salina, ni sawm le ni nga ni pan kipan ni sali sung hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ni masabel ni in biakna vawt khawm vun a, kuama in noma ii ni sim nasep bangma seam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni sali sung ni simin an taw biakpiakna na vawt tu uh hi. A ni liat ni in a bia tu le an taw biakpiakna pia tu in na kikhawm kik tu uh hi. Tua ni sia biak kikhop ni hi a, kuama naseam ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />(Hi biakna poaite sia a kisamh bangin biakna vawt khopna nei a, ni khat zawk ni khat an taw biakpiakna, meihal biakpiakna, antang biakpiakna, sangaw biakpiakna, le sapittui biakpiakna te taw Topa patoaina poaite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hi poaite in Sabbath tan ngeina sia belapna hi a, hi biakpiaknate sia Topa tungah na piak ngengei letsongte le kamciam taangtut biakpiaknate le thinzaw biakpiaknate belapna ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lo an na laak zawk uh ciang, tha salina ni sawm le ni nga ni pan kipan ni sali sung hi poai khaam tu nu hi. Ni masabel ni sia a tuam vilvel tawlngakna ni hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ni in na thingnote ii nga phabelte, palm baakte, thingtee baakboaite pawlkhat la in Topa na Pathian patoaina in biakna poai kipan tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua poai ni sali sung vawt tu nu hi. Hi ngeina sia na suan na paalte ii maisang hun theampo ah a zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel mite theampo ni sali sung bukte sungah teang tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tua hile Topa in Egypt pan hong pusuapui lai in Israel mite ii buk sak tawmte sungah hong teensakna thu na suan na paalte in hong he thei tu hi. Ama in Topa na Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hi bangin Topa patoaina in biakna poaite a khaam ciang Israel mite zui tu ngeinate Moses in pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite in Puanbuk sungah meiinnte a kidet ngei bangin a taan suak thei natu in olive thau phabelte hong paipui natu thupia in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ompuina Thiangthobel Mun sungah a om Thuciamna Thingkuang mai puankhai pua sangah meite, nitak sim Aaron in de a, zingsang dong kuangtopsak tu hi. Hi ngeina sia maisang hun theampo ah zui tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khamh ciitak taw kivawt meikhuamte tungah meite Aaron in keamcing tu a, Topa ompuina ah a ngeina bangin taangsak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anvui kilogramme sawm le nii la in, anluum sawm le ni vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa ompuina mun khamh ciitak taw a kituam sabuai tungah luk veu ngual nii in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anluum taangin Topa tungah a kipia an taw biakpiakna a kilakna in, tua a ngualte tungah ngimnamtui a thiang tawm koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabbath ni sim, maisang hun theampo ah tua anluumte Topa ompuina ah kikoi tu hi. Hisia a tawntungin Israel te sep tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi anluumte Aaron le a suan a paalte neisa hi a, amate in mun thiangthona ah ne tu hi, banghang ziam cile thiampite atu in Topa tungah a kipia a thiangtho mama ante ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasal khat om a, a pa sia Egypt te, a nu sia Israel te Dan minam sung pan Dibri tanu Shelomith a kici sia ahi hi. Tua ngiaphual sungah tua pa sia Israel te khat taw kihau hi. A kihau sungin tua pa in Pathian haamsiat ahikom, Moses kungah paipui uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua pa kikhumcip a, bangbang hi tu ci sia Topa ii amate a son tu ngakin om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tua pa ngiaphual pua sangah paipui vun. Pathian a haamsiat lai in a za theampo in maw hi ci tetti lakna in tua pa lu tungah a khut uh nga tek tu a, tuaciang taangpi bup in suang taw deanglum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang Pathian a haamsiat peuma in a piang bangin thuak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kithatlum tu hi, ci in Israel mite tungah na son tu hi. Israel te khat pawpo ahibuale Israel te sungah a teang ngamdangmi khat pawpo Topa a haamsiat sia taangpi bup in suang taw deanglum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihing a that sia peuma kithat tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ngual nganno khat a that sia peuma in liau kik tu hi. Nuntakna khat sia nuntakna khat taw lo tu ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mihing khat in midang khat a liamsua le, ama vawt babangin a tungah kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in ngu khat a talsak le ama ngu khat kitalsak tu hi; ngual mittang khat a tawsak le ama mittang khat kitawsak tu hi. Ha tang khat a tongsak le ama hatang khat kithoksak tu hi. Midang khat a liamsua babangin ama tungah kithuk kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nganno khat a that sia in liau tu a, ahizong mihing a that sia peuma kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi thukham sia no Israel te le note sungah hong teang ngamdangmite theampo ii zui tu ahi hi, banghang ziam cile Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi thu Moses in Israel mite tungah a son zawkciang, tua pa ngiaphual pua sangah paipui in suang taw deanglum uh hi. Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiak bangin Israel mite in vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Sinai Mual tungah Moses paupui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite tungah a nuai a zui tu ngeinate a piak tu in thupia hi. Topa hong piak tu ngam ah na tum uh ciang a kum sali kum simin lothaw ngawlna taw Topa na upat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum luk sung lo na poai tu uh a, na sapitbaakte tan a puuapha in, lo ante na kaikhawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong a kum salina sia na leitang ii tawlngak kum hi tu a, Topa tungah a ki aap kum hi tu hi. Tua kumin lo an ciing heak vun a, sapitkung zongh pua heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lo sungah a lipo ante zongh la ngawlin na pua ngawl sapitngate zongh lo heak vun. Tua kum sia na leitang ii tawlngak hiithiat kum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua kumin lo a kithaw ngawl hang tua lo in note, na silate, na naseamte, no taw a teang khawm ngamdangmite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na ngannote le ngamsate zongh hong vak tu hi. Tua lo pan a piang theampo kine thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum sali mun salivei simna a kingawm ciang kum 49 ci in sim vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawk tha salina, ni sawm ni, Mawsuutna Ni in ngamsung tengah lemle tum tu in mi khat na paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi bangin kum sawmngana kum sia na koituam tu a, ngam sungah a teang theampo tungah suatakna thu na thangsak tu uh hi. Tua kum in na zuak sa uh vanhte theampo, a nei sia kungah, ahibuale a suan a paalte kungah kipia kik tu hi, sila in a kizuaksa te zongh a innkuanpuite kungah cia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lo na tho buatu uh a, a lipo ante zongh na la buatu uh hi, na ho ngawl sapitngate zongh na lo buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua kum bup note atu in kum thiangtho hi tu a; lote pan a piang tawm teng bek na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi kum sungin a kizuaksa na theampo a neite kungah kilee kiksak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua hi a, Israel na mipuite tungah na lo na zuak ciang, ahibuale ama tung pan lo na lei ciang a kilawm ngawlin kison heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A man sia Piakkikna Jubilee Kum kik dong hi lo pan kum bangza sung, an bangza piang tu cisia tuatin a man kitan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kum a tam le a man tam tu a, ahizong a kum a tawm le a man tawm zaw tu hi, banghang ziam cile a kizuak lo sia pan a piang thei an phaza tungah kibulphu zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel na mipuite theam heak in a, Topa na Pathian ii thu ni in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi ngam sungah ngammuang tak na nuntak thei natu in Topa thukhamte le thupiakte theampo zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitang pan an hong piang tu a, na du theampo nei in, ngammuang takin na nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahizong mihing khat po in tuabang lothaw ngawl, anlaak ngawl bulin, a kum sali kumin bang ne tu hi ziam, hong ci om thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum nii sung an na khom thei natu uh in Topa in a kum luk kumin leitang thupha pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kum liat kumin lo na thaw ciang a kum lukna kumin na laak ante na ne lai tu a, tua kumin na thaw ante na laak dong neakkhom tu na nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na leitang sia a tawntung atu in kizuak thei ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile nang neisa hi ngawl hi; Pathian neisa hi a, no sia thaw khuan a nga ngamdangmite taw na kibang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitang a kizuak ciang a neipa ii tat kik thei natu a thuneina sia heak tek kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel te khat zawng a, a leitang zuak tu a kul le a mealheak kinaibel sia in tan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tan kik tu mealheak a nei ngawl khat sia hong hau kikin a tan kik zo zongh suak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua thu ah a lei kik thei ni in Piakkikna Jubilee kum dong a leitang pan a nga kik tu za taw tuatin a zuakna pa tungah a man pia in tuasia tan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahizong a tat kik natu sum a cin zo buale Piakkikna Jubilee kum kik dong a leipa khut sungah om lai tu hi. Tua kum ciang tuasia a neipa tungah kipia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihing khat in kulh taw ki uum khuapi sungah a om inn khat a zuak le, a zuak hun pan kum khat sung teng tan kik thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahizong tua kum sungin a tan kik zo buale tan kik thei nawn ngawl tu a, a inn sia a leipa le a suan le a paalte neisa hi suak tu hi; Piakkikna Jubilee kum ciang zongh in kipia kik tuan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahizong uumna a nei ngawl khuanote sungah innte sia lote bangin kingaisun tu a, a neipa in tan kik thei tu hi, Jubilee kum ciang kipia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahizong Levi suante in a nasepna khuapite sungah a neisate bang hun po in tat kik thei natu thu nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi khuapite khat sung pan inn khat sia Levi khat in zuak a, a tan kik buale Piakkikna Jubilee kum ciang kipia kik nanak tu hi, banghang ziam cile a khuapi sungah Levi te ii innte sia Israel mite sungah a kip a kho in amate ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Levi khuapite kiimkot ah nganthana leitang ahile kizuak ngeingawl tu hi; tuasia a tawntung amate ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na nai a, a teang Israel mipui khat zawngin ama le ama a kivaak zo buale na nai ah hong teen suak thei natu in na cial naseampa khat bangin sum na puk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama tung pan a meet la heak in a, ahihang Pathian thu ni in na Israel mipuipa na nai ah teangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama, sum na pukna tung pan summeet la heak in a, na anzuakte tung pan a meet la heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hi thu sia Canaan ngam hong piak natu le noma Pathian ahi natu in Egypt ngam pan hong pusuapuipa Topa na Pathian uh ii thu piak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na nai a, a teang Israel na mipui khat a zawn mama hu in sila khat bangin ama le ama hong kizuak le sila nasepte na seamsak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in kuli khat bangin na kungah om tu a, Piakkikna Jubilee kum dong nangma ii na seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuasia hun ciang ama le a tate in nangma hong nusia tu a, a innkuanpuite le a taanghpupite neisa omna ah cia kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel mite sia Topa ii silate hi a, ama in Egypt pan pusuapui hi; amate sila in kizuak ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na Pathian kiita vun a, amate vawtsia heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sila na kisamh le na kiim a om minamte tung pan lei vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Note taw teang khawm ngamdangmite ii tate zongh lei thei tu nu hi. Na ngamsung pan piang tuabang patangte noma neisa suak thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />amate na tapate ii lua tu in na nusiat thei tu a, na tapate ii a nuntak laiteng a na sepsak tu hi. Ahizong Israel na mipuite peuma na vawtsia buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sonteena in note taw teang khawm ngamdangmite khat hong hau a, ahihang na Israel mipui khat zawngin tua pa tung ahibuale a innkuanpuite khat tungah sila in ama le ama hong kizuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama a kizuak zawk hang kitan kik thei lai hi. A suapuite khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ahibuale a pano, a suapuiseal, a kinaipui a beete khat pawpo in tan kik thei tu hi; tua ahibuale ama mama in sum a khom a thalaw le kitan in suakta thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama in a leipa taw kikum tu a, a lei hun a kipan Piakkikna Jubilee kum kik dong a kum simto tu a, naseampa khat a kipia nitha za taw ama suatak natu a man tan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kum sim kuli naseam khat bangin ngaisun in, a taanglai kumte taw tuatin a lei man baang teng pia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A topa in vawtsia ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hi bang lam khat pawpo taw a kisuaktasak buale ama le a tate sia Piakkikna Jubilee kum kik ciang kisuaktasak nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Israel mi khat sia sila hi top thei ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile Israel mite sia Topa silate ahi uh hi. Ama in amate Egypt pan pusuapui hi; ama sia Topa, amate ii Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Biak tu in milimte vawt heak vun, ahibuale suangkhuamte, ahibuale a kizeam suangte phut heak vun. Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakna poaite vawt vun a keima nong biakna mun ciliap vun. Keima in Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka thukham bang nungta in ka thupiakte na zui uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in nguatui hun maanin kong pia tu a, tua hile leitang in an piangsak tu a, thingkungte a nga nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lo ante tam mama tu a, sapitngate law hun dongin lo ante na la lai tu a, thaicii tuu kik hun dongin sapitnga na lo lai tu uh hi. Na du theampo na nei tu a, na ngam sungah ngammuang takin na teang thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na ngam sungah kilemna kong pia tu a, kuama kiita ngawlin na mu thei tu uh hi. Na ngamsung pan ngamsa ngilote ka hawlkeak tu a, tua munah ngal le sa om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ngalte na zo tu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />note mi nga in mi zakhat na zo thei tu uh a, zakhat in tulsawm na zo thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thupha kong pia tu a, ta tam mama kong pia tu hi; note taw ka vawt thuciam sia keima sang pan ka len tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An tam mama na la tu uh a, kum khat na khom tu uh hi, tua zawkciang zong saal sungah a taanglai an kumlui teng anthakte koi natu in na heam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thiangtho ka Puanbuk sungah note taw ka teang tu a, note kong nungngat ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noma taw kong om tu a, na Pathian hi in, note keima mi na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima Topa na Pathian in sila na hi nawn ngawl natu in Egypt pan kong pusuapui hi. Keima in no hong neng suk vaangletna sia ka sumai zo a, vandak sa in hi vaviau in kong kalsuansak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka thu piakte na zui bua uh le daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note taw ka vawt ka thuciam paltan in, ka thukham le ka thupiakte na nial uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />note daan kong pia tu hi. Na mit hong tawsak tu le na nuntakna a bo tu in note tungah tuasiatna — a dam thei ngawl natnate le cisa natnate kong tungsak tu hi. Lo na thaw ancii na poai hangin na phattuamna om ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile na ngalte in hong zo in na ciin po hong neaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngal na lel natu in kong nungngat tu a, hong ngaimaw te in hong uk tu hi; na patau mama tu uh a, hong del om ngawl napi na tatai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hi bang teng zawkciang ka thu nong ni bua veve uh le, na thuak tu uh daan a zaa sali in ka khangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thinpui kiphatsakna ka sumai tu hi; nguatui hang a, na leitangte ko in thik bangin sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hanciam in na nasepna theampo a luithawthong hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile na leitang pan an piang ngawl tu a, thingnote a nga nga ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nong nalh veve lai a, ka thu nong ni bualai uh le, na thuak daan a zaa sali in ka khangsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note sungah a kiitakhuai ngamsate kong puak tu a, na tate, na ngannote hong thalupsakin, note tawm bek taanglai in na lampite uh kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hi bang teng daan na thuak zawk uh ciang ka thu nangai ngawlin nong nial veve lai uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />kong nungngat tu a, a masa lai sangin salivei a nasia zaw daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ih thuciamna na palsat manin daan hong pia tu in no tungah ngalpi kong thengsak tu hi. Na ngammuan natu in khuapi sung na zuan zonghin a dam maw natnate kong tungsak tu a, na ngalte na lel hamtang uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nupi sawm ii a nei anluum theampo a em natu sia anluum emna khat bek a kisap natu zaa dongin na anneak nga natu kong khaktan tu hi. Amate in hong hawmsak tu uh a, na neak zawk uh ciang ngawngawn in na ngilkial lai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hi bang teng zawkciang ka thu ni ngawlin nong nial veve lai uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />no tungah ka thin uukin a masa na daan thuak uh sangin, a salivei a nasia zawin daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na ngil uh kial leilam in, na tate sa na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mual tungah om noma biakna munte ka lalsak tu a, ngimnamtui biaknataute baltham in milim a lalte tungah na mithiluangte ka lawn tu hi. A thasiathuai tatakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />na khuapite ka lalcipsak tu a, na biakna munte siasak in, na sangaw biakpiaknate kong saang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na leitang ka lalcipsak tu a, tuasia a lua na ngalte inghsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngal kong thengsak tu a, ngamdang ah kong thethaang tu hi. Na leitang kitaisan tu a, na khuapite lalcip in kinusia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuasia ciang tawlngak hun na piak ngawl, na leitang ii nuamsa in a tawlngak hunnuam kumte hi tu hi. Tuasia kinusia in ngam thimtham hong suak tu a, na ngalte ngam ah sal na tan hun sung teng na leitang tawlnga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Saltaangin a om note kong patausak mama tu a, vui ii seam thingtee nging sia in note hong taisak tu hi. Ngal kisimna ah ngalte ii del bangin na tai tu uh a, na kiim ah ngal om ngawl napi na liik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kuama hong del om ngawl napi kipaltha in na liik tu uh a, ngalte khat zongh na sim zo buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na saltanna ah na thi tu uh a, na ngalte ii leitang in hong valhlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na ngalte ngam le lei ah a taanglai sun tawmte zongh noma mawna le na taanghpupite mawna hangin na mangthang veve tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Ahizong na suan na paalte in amate mawnate le hong nalh a hong leedo hu in amate mawnate le a taanghpupite mawnate pualaak tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />amate sia keima ii ka nungngat, a ngalte ngam ah salin hong puaksakte ahi uh hi. A khakbel in na suan na paalte a mawna hangin kiniamkhiak a, daan zong thuak zo ahiciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jacob, Isaac, le Abraham taw ka thuciamna ka phawk kik tu a, ka mite Canaan ngam piak tu in ka kamciamna ka thaksua kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahizong hi leitang, a tawlngak hithet thei natu in a ngammite in a masabel in ngam le lei a taisat kul hi, ka thukham le ka thupiakte nial ahikom amate daan ka piak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuabang ahitazong a ngalte ngam sungah a om hun sung zonghin ka nusia bup buatu a, ka mon buatu hi. Tuabangin vawt leng amate taw ka thuciamna bo tu hi, keima in Topa, amate ii Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keima in Topa amate ii Pathian ka hi natu in Egypt ngam pan ka mite ka pusuapui na taw minam theampo tungah ka vaangletna ka lak ciang a taanghpupite taw ka vawt thuciamna ka thaksua tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hi thukhamte le thupiakte theampo sia Israel mite atu in Sinai Mual tungah Topa ii Moses tungah a piakte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite atu a nuai a zui tu ngeinate pia hi. A tuam vilvel kiciamna khat taangtutna in Topa tungah a kipiasa mihing khat sia, a nuai a bangin sumpiakna taw tua pa kisuaktasak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua sumte Biakinn zak ngei khaikhin taw kitee hi: — pasal khanthin kum kul pan kum sawmluk dong: ngunntang 50 — numei khanthin: ngunntang 30 — pa a khangmoi, kum nga pan kum kul dong: ngunntang 20 — numei a khangmoi: ngunntang 10 — patangno kum nga nuaisia : ngunntang 5 — numeino: ngunntang 3 — Pasal kum sawmluk tungsia: ngunntang 15 — Nupi kum sawmluk tungsia: ngunntang 10
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamciamna a vawtpa sia zawng leih in a ngeina bangin a pia zo buale ama sia thiampipa kungah kipaipui tu a, thiampipa in a piak zawkza dong khepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamciamna a vawt sia Topa biakpiakna in a saan thamman nganno khat ahile Topa tungah a kipia letsong theampo biakna taw kisai in a thiangtho hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kamciamna a vawtpa in nganno dang taw laih thei ngawl tu hi. Nganno dang taw a laih le ngannote nii sia Topa neisa hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong kamciamna in a piak tu nganno sia biakna taw kisai in a thiang ngawl hi a, Topa biakpiakna in saan thei ngawl tu ahile, tua pa in tua nganno sia thiampipa kungah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thiampipa in nganno phatna le siatna taw kizui in a man tan tu a, a tan babangin kip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua pa in a lei kik nuam le, a man za le tua man tungah zakhat ciang kul veu belapin lei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat in a inn Topa tungah a aap ciang, thiampipa in a phatna le a siatna zui in a man tan tu a, a tan babang kip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua pa in a inn a lei kik nuam le a man za le tua man tungah zakhat ciang kul veu belapin pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat in a leitang khen khat Topa tungah a aap le, a thai ciin thei tu za tungtawnin a man kitan tu a, mangtaang kilogramme kul ciang ngunntang sawm in kituat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Piakkikna Jubilee kum zawk po ciang a leitang a aap le, a man a cingin tan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Piakkikna Jubilee kum zawk pek ciang a aap le, thiampipa in Jubilee kum kik dong a om lai kumte taw kizui in a man za see tu a, a man khiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khat in a aapsa lo a lei kik nuam ahile a lo man za le tua man tungah zakhat ciang kul veu belap thua in pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa tung pan tuasia lei kik masa ngawlin mi dang khat tungah a zuak le lei kik theina thu sia a bo hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Piakkikna Jubilee kum a cin kik ciang tua lo a tawntungin Topa neisa suak tu a; thiampite in tang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihing khat in ama leisa lo Topa tungah a aap le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thiampipa in mai Piakkikna Jubilee kum dong a kum tuatin a man see tu a, a see zaza tua pa in tua ni in pia nanak tu hi; tua sum teng Topa aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Piakkikna Jubilee kum a cin ciang tua lo a neiphitpa tungah ahibuale a suan a paalte tungah ki aap kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakinn zak ngei khaikhin taw kizui in na man theampo a man kitan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nganhing no suakciil peuma Topa neisa hi zo ahiciang, kuama in thinzaw biakpiakna in Topa tungah aap thei ngawl tu hi. Khuino, tuuno, ahibuale kealno khat Topa neisa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahizong a thiang ngawl nganhing no suakciil ahile, a man a kitan za le tua a man tung zakhat ciang kul veu belapin lei kik thei tu hi. A kilei kik buale tua nganhing sia a man a kitan za taw midang khat pawpo tungah kizuak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa tungah thudang om ngawl tu in a aap thiang sitsetsa, mihing, nganhing, ahibuale leitang khat sia kuama in zuak kik, lei kik thei ngawl tu hi. A tawntungin Topa neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihing ngawngawn tuabang a ki aap thiang sitset sa te tat kik thei tu hi ngawl hi; ama sia kithatlum nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na leitang pan a piang theampo, an le thingngate sawm a khat Topa ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi khat in tuate a tan kik nuam le, a man za le a man tungah zakhat ciang kul veu belapin tan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na khoai sa ngannote sawm a khat Topa ii neisa ahi hi. Na nganno na sim ciang a sawmna nganno sia veu Topa ii neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A neipa in a sim ciang a sawmna nganno sia a tha zawmbel a teal thei natu in vawt kaltang ngawl tu a, a kitealsa khat theak kik thei ngawl tu hi. A theak kik ahile tua nganhingte nii sia Topa ii neisa hi tu a, kilei kik thei ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hite Israel mite atu in Sinai Mual tungah Topa ii Moses tungah a thupiakte ahi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
